<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- NGONI Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matendu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matendu ga Mitumi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matendu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mate</para>
  <para style="mt2">Matendu ga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mitumi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Matendu ndi mdandaula wa kutumbula kwa Msambi wa vandu vevamsadika Kilisitu na kudandasika kwaki kuhuma ku Yelusalemu mbaka ku Yudea na Samaliya, na kutali neju, ngati Yesu cheavajovili vawuliwa vaki kwakona kutoliwa kuhamba kunani Matendu (musula ya 1:8). Chitabu cha Matendu chayandikwi na mtumi Luka na mewa ndi mweayandiki Linenu la Bwina ngati chegayandikwi na Luka. Mweanuyo avi mlamisa na ayandiki kwa kulanda bwina mambu chegahumili kwa uchakaka. Ayandiki vitabu vyoha vivili Linenu la Bwina na Matendu ga mitumi kwa Teofili mweavi Mgiliki, Nambu mpangu waki wavi ndava ya vamsadika voha Vagiliki na Vayawudi (musula ya 1:1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Matendu ga mitumi chayandikwi pagati ya mwaka 60-64 peamali kuvelekewa Yesu chitabu chamaliki kuyandikwa lukumbi mtumi Pauli akona muchifungu. Mewa Luka agendili pamonga na mtumi Pauli yisadikika kuvya chitabu cha Matendu ga mitumi chayandikwi pamuji wa ku Antiokia. Chitabu ichi cha matendu ga mitumi chiyendeleza Linenu la Bwina ngati cheayandiki Luka na chitumbula pala Yesu kutoliwa kunani kwa Chapanga. Chechamkitili Luka ayandika chitabu ichi ndi mewawa chechamkitili ayandika chitabu cha Linenu la Bwina. Amganili Teofili na pamonga na vandu vevamsadiki Kilisitu vevayonjokisiki vavyai na uchakaka wa gala gevawuliwi. Ndava yeniyo ayandiki kwa uchakaka mambu gegahumili kwa Yesu peatama pamulia apa na kudandasika kwa vandu vevamsadika Kilisitu kila pandu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Matendu cheatipelili miluhumu ya msambi wa kutumbula vandu vevamsadiki Kilisitu, kutama kwa kusadika wa Yesu ndi chindu kiki. Miluhumu ya vanalihengu yikutulangisa ndava ya kuhuvalila makakala ga Mpungu Msopi ndava ya mukudandasa ujumbi wa Linenu la Bwina kwa vandu vangi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Kutumbula Mpungu Msopi avahulukili vawuliwa va Yesu na msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ukatumbula kukula (musula ya 1:1-8:1).</para>
  <para style="io">Kavili Msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ving'aiswa na kutumbula kudandasika kuvala Yelusalemu (musula ya 8:2-12:23).</para>
  <para style="io">Mewa Pauli akahamba lugendu lwa kutumbula lwa lihengu la utumi (musula za 12:24-14:28).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi libanji lakonganiki ku Yelusalemu ndava ya kuhamula ndava ya mambu gegiganikiwa kwa vandu vamupya vevamsadiki Kilisitu (musula ya 15:1-35).</para>
  <para style="io">Kavili Pauli ihamba lugendu lwa pili lwa utumi waki (musula ya 15:36-18:22).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi ahambili lugendu lwa datu lwa utumi waki (musula ya 18:23-20:38).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Pauli ikamuliwa ku Yelusalemu (musula ya 21-26).</para>
  <para style="io">Pamwishu Pauli ipelekwa ku Loma (musula za 27-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Mlongo Teofili, muchitabu cha kutumbula nayandiki kugavala mambu goha, Yesu geagahengili na kugawula kwakona kutumbula lihengu laki, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mbaka ligono lila Yesu peatoliwi kunani kwa Chapanga. Avalagizi munjila ya Mpungu Msopi vamitumi vala veavahagwili. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Mulukumbi lwa magono alobaini kuhuma mulifwa laki, avahumalili pamahele kulangisa kuvya avi mumi. Vamuwene mwene alongili nawu ndava ya Unkosi wa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Lukumbi lwe akonganiki nawu pamonga avalagazili. “Mkotoka kuwuka pa Yelusalemu, ndi mlindila njombi yeavalagazili Dadi, yemmali kuniyuwana nilongela ndava yaki. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohani abatizi kwa manji, nambu magono gadebe gegigelekela, nyenye yati mbatiziwa kwa Mpungu Msopi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu itoliwa kuhamba kunani kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maluko 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Vanalihengu pavakonganiki pamonga na Yesu, vakamkota, “Wu Bambu, lukumbi ulu ndi pawiwuyisa unkosi wula kwa Isilaeli?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Lusenje na lukumbi lwa mambu ago uvili pahi ya uhotola wa Dadi wangu, lihengu linu lepi kumanya yati givya ndali. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Nambu lukumbi Mpungu Msopi peakuvahelelela nyenye, ndi yati mwipokela makakala na kuvya mwemwijova ndava yangu pagati ya muji wa Yelusalemu pamulima woha wa ku Yudea na ku Samaliya, na hati pamwishu wa mulima.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Peamali kujova genago, kuni voha vakumlolokesa, akatoliwa kunani kwa Chapanga, lihundi likamfiya vakotoka kumlola kavili.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Pevayendalili kulolokesa kunani, kuni mwene ihamba, bahapo vandu vavili vevawalili nyula za msopi vayimili papipi na vene, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />vakajova, “Nyenye vandu va ku Galilaya! Ndava kyani myima kulolokesa kunani? Yesu mwenuyu mweatoliwi kuhuma kwinu, mewawa yati iwuya kavili ngati chemumuwene ihamba kunani kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matia ihaguliwa akamula pandu pa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Matei 27:3-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Kangi vamitumi vakawuya Yelusalemu kuhuma kuchitumbi chila chechikemelewa Mizeituni chechavili utali wa kilomita yimonga kuhuma kumujini. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Pavahikili pamuji vakakwela kugolofa kwevatamayi, vavi Petili na Yohani na Yakobo na Andelea na Filipi na Tomasi na Batolomei na Matei na Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo, Simoni Zeloti chikundi cha Vayawudi vevibela ulongosi wa Loma, na Yuda mwana wa Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Voha ava vakakonganeka kumuyupa Chapanga, pamonga na vadala na Maliya nyina waki Yesu na valongo vaki.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Magono ago, Petili ayimili pagati ya valongo vamsadika vala vevakonganiki, voha vavi vandu miya yimonga na ishilini, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />akajova, “Valongo vangu, yaganikiwi Mayandiku Gamsopi gatimilayi, pandu pala Mpungu Msopi, alotili mu malovi ga Daudi kumvala Yuda mweavalongwisi vala vevamkamwili Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda avi mmonga wa chikundi chitu muni ahaguliwi kuhenga lihengu la chitumi pamonga na tete.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Mwene agulili mgunda kwa mashonga geagapatili ndava ya kumng'anamukila Yesu, akagwa pahi na kupapuka, maleme gaki gakahuma kuvala. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Lijambu lenilo likayuwanikana kwa kila mundu wa Yelusalemu, hati kwa luga yavi vakaukemela mgunda wula Hakeli Dama, mana yaki “Mgunda wa Ngasi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Hinu yiyandikiwi muchitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">nyumba yaki yisigalila mang'ova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">mundu yoyoha akotoka kutama mwenumo.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Kangi yiyandikiwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">Mundu yungi atola pandu pa lihengu laki.<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Ndi mundu mmonga pagati yinu, mwealandini na tete lukumbi lwoha Bambu Yesu peavi mulugendu pamonga na tete ahaguliwa kuwungana na tete, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />mwenuyo yiganikiwa kuvya mmonga wa vala vevalandini na tete, kutumbula Yohani peavili mukubatiza mbaka ligono lila Yesu peatoliwi kuhuma kwitu kuhamba kunani kwa Chapanga. Mwenuyo ndi iwungana na tete kujova ndava ya kuyuka kwa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Hinu, vakaluwula mahina gavili, wa mmonga Yosefu mweikemiwa Basaba mewa Yusto, na yungi Matia. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Kangi vakamuyupa Chapanga, “Bambu, veve ukiyimanya mitima ya vandu voha. Hinu utilangisa yani mwemhagwili pagati ya vavili ava, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />muni atola pandu pa lihengu la chitumi lealekili Yuda, mwene awukili kuhamba pandu paki mwene.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Vakamhagula na Matia ndi akahaguliwa mwene ayonjokeswa pagati ya vamitumi kumi na mmonga vala.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Mpungu Msopi akuvahelelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Ligono la Pentekoste palahikili vamsadika voha vakonganiki pandu pamonga. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Chighafula, lwami lukayuwanika kuhuma kunani ngati chimbungululu chivaha, chikamema nyumba yoha yevatamili. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Kangi, vikahumila vindu vyevyawonikini ngati lulimi lwa motu, lukalekengana na kutula panani ya kila mmonga wavi. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Voha vakamemeswa Mpungu Msopi na kutumbula kujova luga ndalindali ngati Mpungu cheavahotwisi.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Na ku Yelusalemu kwavi na Vayawudi, vandu vevakumtopesa Chapanga vevahumila kila likabila pamulima. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Pevayuwini lwami lula, msambi uvaha wa vandu ukakonganeka. Voha vakakenyemuka neju muni kila mmonga wavi avayuwini vandu vala vijova kwa luga yaki mwene. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Vakavya na chinamtiti na kukangasa vakajova, “Wu, ava vetikuvayuwana, lepi vakolonjinji va ku Galilaya! <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Hinu, yivi wuli, tete kuvayuwana kila mmonga ijova kwa luga yaki mwene? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Pagati yitu vavi vandu kuhuma ku Paliti vangi ku Medi na vangi ku Elami na vangi vakolonjinji va Mesopotamia na Yudea na Kapodokia na Ponto na Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Flugia na Pamfulia na Misili na vangi kuhuma Libiya papipi na Kulene na vangi vitu ndi vayehe kuhuma ku Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Vayawudi na vangalikuvya Vayawudi, nambu vilanda njila ya kumuyupa Chapanga ya Vayawudi, vangi vahumili ku Kilete na Alabia. Tavete tikuvayuwana vijova kwa luga zitu ndi matendu gakulu ga Chapanga.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Voha vakakangasa na kuvagaya kuni vikotana, “Yeniyi mana yaki kiki?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Nambu vangi vakavavevesa vakajova, “Vandu ava vagalili ugimbi!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Kangi Petili akayima pamonga na vamitumi kumi na mmonga vala akatumbula kuvakokosela vandu. Valongo Vayawudi na mwavoha nyenye mwemwitama ku Yelusalemu, myuwanila malovi gangu. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Lepi chemwihololela vandu ava vagalili muni ndi saa yidatu ya lukela. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Nambu lijambu lenili ndi chakaka lelalongaliki na Yoeli mweavili mlota wa Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Bambu ijova, mumagono gala gamwishu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">nikuvamemesa Mpungu wangu vandu voha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">vana vinu vagosi na vadala yati vilota ulota wa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">vasongolo vinu yati vilola maono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">na vagogo vinu yati vilota munjozi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ena, hati vatumisi vangu, voha vagosi na vadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">yati nikuvapela Mpungu wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">navene yati vilotela.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Yati nikita gachinamtiti kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">na kukita milangisu pahi pamulima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">Yati kwiva na ngasi, motu na lyohi litopanu.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Lilanga yati ligubikwa na chitita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">na mwehi walavya mdung'u ngati ngasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">kwakona kuhumila ligono likulu la ukulu wa Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Mewawa mundu yoyoha mweiyupa kwa liina la Bambu yati isanguliwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Vandu va Isilaeli myuwanila! Yesu wa ku Nazaleti avi mundu, uhotola waki wa uchapanga walangisi kwinu kwa gachinamtiti na makangaso na milangisu. Chapanga yeahengili kwa nyenye kwa njila yaki, ngati mwavene chemwimanya. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Ndava ya mpangu waki mwene Chapanga, amali kuhamula kuvya Yesu agotolewa kwa nyenye, na mwavene mwamkomili kwa kuvaleka vandu vahakau vamkoma na kumvamba mu msalaba. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Nambu Chapanga amyukisi kuhuma kwa vevafwili, amsangwili kuhuma mu mvinisu wa lifwa, ndava muni yihotoleka lepi lifwa limkunga. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Muni Daudi ajovili aga kumvala mwene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Namuwene Bambu palongolo yangu lukumbi lwoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">avi pamonga na nene upandi wa kulyelela, hati ninyugusika lepi.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ndi muni mtima wangu waganisiwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">na kululuta kwa luheku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Hati higa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">yati yitama kwa kuhuvalila,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Ndava nakuuleka mpungu wangu kulitinda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">wala kumlekekesa Msopi waku awola.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Unilangisi njila za wumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">ndava ya kuvya kwaku unimemisi luheku.’”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Valongo vangu, nigana kuvajovela hotohoto kumvala mambu gegampatili gogo witu Daudi. Mwene afwili na kuzikiwa na litinda laki livii kwitu mbaka lelu. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Nambu Daudi ndava avili mlota wa Chapanga amanyili kuvya Chapanga amlapakisi kwa lilaganu yati akumhagula mmonga wa chiveleku waki kuvya nkosi pahali paki. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Daudi agaweni kwakona mambu aga gegihengeka na Chapanga, hinu akajova ndava ya kuyuka kwa Kilisitu, lukumbi peajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Nakulekewa mu litinda la mbugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">higa yaki yawoli lepi.’<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Chapanga amyukisi Yesu na tavoha tete ndi vetijova ndava ya lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Yesu peamali kukweswa na kuvikwa upandi wa kulyelela wa Chapanga ndi akapokela kuhuma kwa Dadi, Mpungu Msopi yula mweatiahidi, atimemimisi Mpungu wene. Chenicho ndi chetikuchiwona hinu na kuyuwana. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Muni Daudi nakukwela mbaka kunani kwa Chapanga, muni ngamwene ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Bambu amjovili Bambu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">tama upandi wangu wa kulyela,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mbaka penikuvavika makoko gaku kuvya chigoda cha kuvikila magendelu gaku.’”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Vandu voha va Isilaeli viganikiwa kumanya kwa uchakaka kuvya Yesu mwenuyo mwevamkomili na kumvamba mu msalaba, ndi Chapanga amviki kuvya Bambu na Kilisitu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Hinu, vandu pavagayuwini genago, mitima yawavinili, vakavakota Petili na pamonga na vamitumi vayaki. “Valongo vitu tikita wuli?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petili akavayangula, “Mumuwuyila Chapanga na kila mmonga winu abatiziwa kwa liina la Yesu Kilisitu, muni mulekekesewayi kubumdila Chapanga na kupokela njombi yila ya Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Muni lilaganu lila lavi ndava yinu na ndava ya vana vinu na ndava ya voha vevitama kutali ndava ya kila mundu mweikemiwa na Bambu Chapanga witu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Kwa malovi gangi gamahele, Petili avajovili hotohoto vandu “Vajisangula na chiveleku ichi chihakau.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Vamahele pagati yavi vagasadiki malovi ga Petili na kubatiziwa, na vandu vevayonjokisiki vavi ngati elufu zidatu ligono lenilo. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Venavo voha vayendalili kujiwula kuhuma kwa vamitumi na kutama pamonga cha lukolo, kulya pamonga na kumuyupa kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wumi wa kila ligono wa vamsadika vala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Gachinamtiti na makangaso gamahele gahengiki munjila ya vamitumi hati kila mmonga akakangaswa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Vamsadika voha vayendalili kuvya chindu chimonga na vindu vyavi vatangatilanayi kwa pamonga. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Vavi mukugulisa kila chindu pamonga na kangi kugavana mashonga kuwanangana ngati avi na la liganu la mmonga wavi. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Kila ligono vayendalili kukonganeka pamonga Munyumba ya Chapanga. Mewa lukumbi lwa kulya vakonganiki pamonga munyumba zavi na vilya kwa luheku na mtima wa msopi. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Vakamulumbalila Chapanga, vakaganwa na vandu voha. Kila ligono Bambu akavayonjokesela mu msambi vandu vevasanguliwi.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Kulamiswa kwa ngagenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ligono limonga, lukumbi lwa saa tisa ya muhi, Petili na Yohani vavi mukuhamba Kunyumba ya Chapanga lukumbi lwa kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Hinu mundu mmonga mweavi ngagenda tangia peavelekiwi. Kila ligono vandu vamgegayi na kumvika pamlyangu wa Nyumba ya Chapanga weukemelewa “Mlyangu Wabwina.” Muni avayupayi vindu kwa vala veviyingila Munyumba ya Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Peavawene Petili na Yohani viyingila Munyumba ya Chapanga, avayupili vampela mashonga. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Vene vakamlolokesa takataka, ndi Petili akamjovela, “Utilola!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Ngagenda yula akavalola, ahololela ipewa chindu kuhuma kwavi. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Nambu Petili akamjovela, “Nivii lepi na mashonga amala zahabu, nambu chenivi nachu yati nikukupela. Kwa uhotola wa Yesu Kilisitu wa ku Nazaleti, yima ugendayi!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Hinu akamkamula chiwoko cha kulyelela, akamyinula. Bahapo magendelu na mafugamilu gaki gakavya na makakala. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Akahumba, akayima na kutumbula kugenda. Ndi akayingila nawu pamonga Munyumba ya Chapanga, igenda na kuhumba humba kuni akumlumbalila Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Vandu voha vevavi penapo vamuwene igenda na kumlumbalila Chapanga, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />pavammanyili kuvya mwene ndi yula mweatama papipi na Mlyangu Wabwina Wa Nyumba ya Chapanga, na kuyupa vakakangasa neju hati nakugamanya gegamkolili.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa Petili Munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Lukumbi pavamuwene mundu yula alongosini na Petili na Yohani, vandu voha vakavya mumkangaso ndi vajumbalili pandu pepakemeliwi “Libanji la Solomoni.” <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Hinu, Petili peavawene vandu, akavajovela, vandu va Isilaeli, ndava kyani mwikangaswa na lijambu ili? Kyani mukutilolokesa takataka ngati kwa makakala gitu amala ndava ya umsopi witu tavete timuhengili mundu uyu ahotola kugenda? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Chapanga wa Ibulahimu na Izaki na Yakobo, ndi Chapanga wa vagogo vitu ampeli amulumbalili mtumisi waki Yesu. Nambu nyenye mwamkamwili na kumgotola kwa vachilongosi na kumng'anamukila na kumbela palongolo ya Pilatu, hati peamwili kumdindulila. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Mwene avili mweikita geigana Chapanga na msopi, nambu nyenye mwambelili ndi mwayupili mundu yungi mweavimkomaji adinduliwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Nyenye mwamkomili chanzu cha wumi, nambu Chapanga amyukisi kuhuma kwa vafwili, tavete taliwene lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Makakala na kumsadika Yesu ndi vyevi mpeli makakala mundu uyu mwemukumlola na kummanya. Sadika kwa Yesu ndi yeyimlamisi hotohoto mundu uyu ngati mwavoha chemukumlola.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Hinu, valongo vangu, nimanyili kuvya nyenye na vachilongosi vinu mwahengili ago ndava mwamanyili lepi. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Nambu Chapanga agahengili ago goha geajovili munjila ya vamlota va Chapanga voha kuvya yamganili Kilisitu ang'aika. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Muleka kubuda na mumuwuyila Chapanga, ndi mwene avalekekesa kumubudila. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Mukita genago, muni Bambu avapela lusenje lwa kupoleswa mitima na kuvaletela Kilisitu mweavahagulili ndi Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Yikumgana mwene kusigalila kunani kwa Chapanga mbaka palubwela lukumbi vindu vyoha kukitwa vya mupya, ngati Chapanga cheajovili munjila ya vamlota vaki vamsopi vevatamili kadeni. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Muni, Musa ajovili, ‘Bambu Chapanga winu akuvayinulila mlota wa Chapanga ngati nene kuhuma kwa nyenye mwavene. Mumyuwanila mwene mu mambu goha geakuvajovela nyenye. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Mundu yoyoha mwangamyuwanila mlota wa Chapanga mwenuyo, yati ibaguliwa kutali na vandu va Chapanga na kukomewa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Vamlota voha va Chapanga kuhuma Samweli na vangi vevagelekili, vakokwisi mambu aga gegihumila magono aga. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Na Chapanga alagazili vamlota vaki ndava yinu, na muyingila mu lilaganu leahengili na vagogo vitu, ngati chamjovili Ibulahimu, ‘Mu chiveleku chaku na vandu voha va pamulima yati vimotisiwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ndi Chapanga amyukisi mtumisi waki, amtumili hoti kwa nyenye, avamotisa na kumkita kila mmonga winu alekana na uhakau waki.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Petili na Yohani vipelekwa pa libanji la mihalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petili na Yohani pevayendalili kuvakokosela vandu, vamteta va Chapanga na valonda va Nyumba ya Chapanga na chikundi cha Vasadukayu ndi vandu vevisadika kuvya vandu nakuhotola kuyuka vakavabwelela. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Vakamema ligoga, muni vamitumi vala vakuvakokosela vandu kuvya Yesu ayukili lijambu lelilangisa hotohoto kuvya vafwili yati viyuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Hinu Petili na Yohani ndi vakamuliwi na kuyingiswa muchifungu mbaka chilau yaki ndava yavi kimihi. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Nambu vamahele pagati ya vevayuwini ujumbi wavi vakasadika, na vamsadika vakayonjokeseka jumula yavi vakavya ngati vagosi elufu mhanu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Chilau yaki, vachilongosi va Vayawudi vagogo na vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa vakakonganeka pamonga ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Vakonganiki pamonga na Mteta Mkulu Anasi na Kayafa na Yohani na Alekizanda na vangi voha vevavi va lukolo lwa Mteta Mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Pavavayimiki Petili na Yohani palongolo yavi, vakavakota, “Nyenye mwihenga lijambu lenili kwa makakala ga yani amala kwa uhotola wa yani?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Petili kuni amemiswi Mpungu Msopi akavayangula, “Vachilongosi na vagogo va vandu! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ngati lelu mukutikota kuchivala chitendu chila chabwina cheahengiwi ngagenda yula na kulama, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />hinu, nyenye na vandu voha va pa Isilaeli yikuvagana kumanya kuvya mundu mwenuyo iyima palongolo yinu lelu, alamili hotohoto, kwa makakala ga Yesu Kilisitu wa ku Nazaleti, nyenye mwevamvambili pamsalaba, nambu Chapanga amyukisi kuhuma kwa vafwili. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu mwenuyo ndi Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Liganga lemwabelili nyenye vakujenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">hinu ndi liganga likulu la mkingisa pakujenga.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Usangula wipatikana munjila ya mwene ndu, pamulima poha kawaka hati mmonga mweapewili na Chapanga uhotola wa kutisangula.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Vachilongosi va libanji vakavakangasa Petili na Yohani chavidandaula cha ukekesi, vavamanyili kuvya vavi vandu vangasoma wala ilimu yoyoha. Vakamanya kuvya vavi pamonga na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Nambu pavamuwene mundu yula mwealamisiwi ayimili pamonga nawu, nakuhotola kujova chindu. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Hinu vakavajovela vahuma kuvala ya libanji lila na kuni vene vakasigalila mugati kulongela vene kwa vene. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Vakakotana, “Tikita kyani na vandu venava? Mundu yoyoha mweitama pa Yelusalemu imanyalila kuvya ulangisu uwu wa chinamtiti uhengiki, tete nakuhotola kubela lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Nambu lenili tihotola kugunisa lijambu lenili likoto kudandasika kwa vandu, ndi tivabesa vakotoka kulongela na mundu yoyoha kwa uhotola wa Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Hinu vakavakemela kavili mugati, vakavabesa vakotoka kulongela amala kuwula vandu kwa uhotola wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Nambu Petili na Yohani vakavayangula, “Mwavene muamula ngati chabwina palongolo ya Chapanga kuvayidakila nyenye kuliku kumyidakila Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Ndava muni nakuhotola kuleka kulongela kugavala mambu gala getagawene na kuyuwana.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ndi vachilongosi va libanji vakavaywangila cha ligoga, kangi vakavalekekesa. Nakuhotola kuvalipisa ndava muni vandu voha vamlumbalila Chapanga ndava ya lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Mundu yula mweahengiwi ulangisu wa kulama avi na umuli wa miyaka yeyiyonjokesa alobaini.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamsadika vakumuyupa Chapanga avakangamalisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bahapo pavalekeswi Petili na Yohani vakawuya kwa vayavi, vakavajovela gala gevajoviwi na vakulu va kuteta va Chapanga na vachilongosi. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Navene pavagayuwini malovi ago, vakawungana pamonga kumuyupa Chapanga vakajova, “Bambu, veve ndi mweuwumbili kunani na pamulima na nyanja pamonga vindu vyoha vyeviyili! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ndi mweumhotwisi mtumisi waku, dadi witu Daudi ajova kwa makakala ga Mpungu Msopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Ndava kyani makabila gamemili ligoga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Ndava kyani vandu vakiti mipangu ya waka?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Vankosi va pamulima vayimili ndava ya ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na vachilongosi vakokanganiki pamonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">ndava ya kumbela Bambu na Kilisitu.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Muni, chakaka ndi Helodi na Ponsio Pilatu na vandu va Isilaeli na vandu va vangali Vayawudi vakonganiki pabomani apa, kumbela mtumisi waki wa Msopi ndi Yesu mwewamuhagwili. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Muni vahenga mambu geugapangili kutumbula kadeni kwa makakala gaku na kwa uhamula waku. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Nambu hinu, Bambu, lola chaviyogofya. Utikangamalisa tavatumisi vaku kukokosa linenu laku cha ukekesi. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Talambula chiwoko chaku uvalamisa vandu, na kita ulangisu na chinamtiti kwa uhotola wa Yesu mtumisi waku wa Msopi.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Pevamalili kuyupa kwa Chapanga pandu pala pakanyugusika, navene voha vakamemeswa Mpungu Msopi. Vakayendelela kukokosa linenu la Chapanga changali wogohi.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamsadika vatangatilini kila chindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Vamsadika voha vavi mtima umonga na mpungu umonga. Avi lepi hati mmonga wavi mweavi na chindu chochoha, mweachivikili kuvya chaki mwene, ndi vagavini vyoha vyevavi navyu. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Kwa makakala gavaha, vamitumi vakajova ndava ya kuyuka kwaki Bambu Yesu, na Chapanga akavamotisa neju. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Kawaka mundu mwangali chindu, muni vevavi na migunda amala nyumba vagulisi na kugega mashonga gala, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />na kugagotola kwa vamitumi vala, mashonga ago vagavanayi kwa kila mundu ndava ya vindu vyeaganili.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Kwavili na mundu mmonga Mlawi, mkolonjinji wa Kuplo, liina laki Yosefu vamitumi vamkemelayi Banaba mana yaki “Mundu mweikangamalisa mtima.” <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Mewawa mwene agulisi mgunda waki, akatola mashonga genago na kuvagotolela vamitumi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Anania na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Nambu mundu mmonga liina laki Anania na mdala waki Safila vagulisi mewa chipandi cha mgunda wavi. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Na mdala waki amanyili hotohoto kuvya mgwana waki afiyili mashonga gangi geapewili, na zingi zila azigotwili kwa vamitumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Petili akamkota, “Anania ndava kyani Setani auyingili mtima waku na kumkonga Mpungu Msopi ujifiyili mashonga gangi geupewili mumgunda wula? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Kwakona kugulisa mgunda wenuwo wavi waku, na pawaligulisi mashonga gala gavi gaku, uhengela chewigana. Ndava kyani, wahamwili mumtima waku kuhenga lijambu lenili? Umkongili lepi mundu, nambu umkongili Chapanga!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Anania peagayuwini malovi ago, akagwa pahi akafwa na vandu voha vevagayuwini mambu ago vakayogopa neju. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Vasongolo vakabwela, vakamugubika higa yaki kwa nyula ya msopi, vakamuwusa kuvala vakamuzika.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Pagamaliki masaa ngati gadatu, mdala waki changali kumanya mambu gegahumalili, akayingila mugati mula. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petili akamkota, “Unijovela! Wu mashonga gemwapewili kwa kugulisa mgunda ndi gagaga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Ndi mwene akamyangula, “Ena, ndi genaga.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Hinu, Petili akamjovela mdala yula, “Wuli muyidakilini kumlinga Mpungu wa Bambu? Yuwanila! Vandu vala vevahambili kumzika mgwana waku, hinu vavi pamlyangu ndi yati vakukutola mewa na veve.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Bahapo safila akagwa palongolo ya magendelu ga Petili, akafwa. Vasongolo vala pavayingili vamkolili amali kufwa, ndi vakamuwusa kuvala, vakamuzika papipi na mngwana waki. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Wogohi uvaha ukavayingila msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu voha na vandu voha, vevayuwini malovi ga lijambu lenilo.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanalihengu vihengili gachinamtiti na makangaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Chapanga ahengili kwa njila ya vanalihengu gachinamtiti na makangaso gamahele pagati ya vandu. Na vamsadika vakonganikayi pamonga mulibanji la Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Mundu yungi yoyoha angalikuvya msadika, valingili lepi kuwungana nawu. Nambu vandu vangi vangasadika vavalumbalili. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Nambu vandu vamahele vevamsadiki Bambu, vagosi na vadala vakayonjokeseka neju. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Hati vandu vavagegili vatamu vavi munjila na kuvagonesa mu lusongwani na mumipasa, muni Petili akapitayi, mbanga chimuwili chaki chivahikila vangi pagati yavi. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Vandu vamahele vabwelili kuhuma mumiji yeyitindila Yelusalemu, vavaletili vatamu wavi na vevavi na mizuka yihakau, ndi voha vakalamiswa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamitumi ving'aiswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Kangi, Mteta Mkulu na vayaki va chikundi cha Vasadukayu ndi vandu vevisadika kuvya vandu nakuhotola kuyuka va pandu penapo, vakayva na wihu kwa vamitumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Hinu vakavakamula vamitumi na kuvakunga muchifungu chikulu. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Nambu kilu mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga, akadindula mlyangu wa muchifungu yikulu, akavahumisa kuvala, akavajovela, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Muhambayi mukayima Munyumba ya Chapanga, mkavajovela vandu malovi ga kuuvala wumi wa mupya.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Vamitumi vakayidakila, vakayingila Munyumba ya Chapanga lukela pehe, vakatumbula kuwula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mteta Mkulu na vayaki pavahikili, vakemili mngonganu wa libanji likulu na vagogo voha va Isilaeli, kangi vavatumili vandu kujela vavaleta vamitumi vala. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Nambu valonda va muchifungu pavahikili, vavakolili lepi. Ndi vakawuya na kujova kwa vakulu va libanji, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Tikolili jela yidindanu na valonda vavi mumilyangu kulindalila. Nambu patadindwili milyangu tamkolili lepi mundu yoyoha mugati.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Mkulu wa valonda wa Nyumba ya Chapanga na Vamteta Vakulu pevayuwini genago, vakavya na wogohi, ndava nakuchimanya chechavakolili. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Kangi, akabwela mundu mmonga na kuvajovela, “Yuwanila! Vandu vala vemkavakungili muchifungu, hinu vavi Munyumba ya Chapanga vakuvawula vandu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Bahapo mkulu wa valonda na vahenga lihengu vaki, vakahamba Munyumba ya Chapanga vakavaleta. Nambu nakuvakamula kwa makakala, muni vayogwipi vandu yati vakuvatova na maganga.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Hinu, vavapeliki vamitumi vala, vakavayimika palongolo ya libanji, ndi Mteta Mkulu akavajovela, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Tavabesili hotohoto kuwula paliina la mundu uyu, hinu mugadandisi mawuliwu ginu pa Yelusalemu poha mwigana kutigegesa ngasi ya mundu uyu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petili pamonga na vamitumi vayaki vakayangula, “Yikutigana kumyidakila Chapanga, kuliku mundu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Chapanga wa vagogo vitu amyukisi Yesu mwemwamkomili nyenye na kumvamba pamsalaba. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Mwenuyu ndi yula mwealumbiwi na Chapanga mbaka upandi wa kulyelela, kuvya Chilongosi na Msangula, muni avakita vandu va Isilaeli vamuwuyila Chapanga, muni vapata kulekekesewa kumbudila. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Tete ndi taliwene lijambu lenilo, na Mpungu Msopi, Chapanga avapelili vala vevakumyidakila mwene.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Vajumbi voha va libanji lila pevayuwini genago, vakamema ligoga vakahamula kuvakoma. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Nambu mundu mmonga Mfalisayu liina laki Gamalieli, muwula wa malagizu ga Bambu geampeli Musa na mweitopeswa na vandu voha. Akayima mu libanji palongolo ya vandu akalagiza vamitumi vala vawusiwayi kuvala mulukumbi luhupi. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Kangi akavajovela vajumbi va libanji vala, “Vandu va Isilaeli, mjiyangalila kwakona mwangakita, chemwigana kuvakitila vandu ava! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Magono ga mumbele, ahumalili mundu mmonga liina laki Teudosi, akajijovela kuvya mundu wa kutopela, vandu ngati miya mcheche vakajiwunga nayu. Nambu akomiwi, kangi vamulanda vaki vakapechengana chikundi chaki chafwili. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Mwanakandahi kavili, lukumbi lwa kuvalangiwa vandu, ahumalili Yuda wa ku Galilaya. Mewawa mwenuyo avakulukisi vandu vakamulanda, nambu mwenuyo mewawa akomiwi vamulanda vaki vakapechengana. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Hinu nene nikuvajovela ndava ya mhalu uwu, mujiyepa na vandu ava! Mvalekayi vahamba. Ndava muni ngati mpangu wenuwo utumbuliwi na vandu yati wiyaga wene. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Nambu ngati mpangu wenuwu uhumili kwa Chapanga, nakuhotola kuvabesa vandu ava, muni mwavene yati mukujikolela mukumbela Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Ndi vakayidakilana na malovi ga Gamalieli. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Hinu, vakavakemele vamitumi vala, vakahamula vatovewa michapilu na kuvabesa vakotoka kuwula kavili paliina la Yesu, ndi vakavaleka vahamba. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Hinu, vamitumi vakahuma mu libanji kuni vamemi luheku, muni Chapanga avahololili kuvya vene yavaganili kukola soni ndava ya liina la Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Kila ligono vayendalili kuwula na kukokosa Munyumba ya Chapanga na munyumba za vandu, Linenu la Bwina la Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Vamtangatila saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mwanakandahi vawuliwa pevayendalili kuyonjokeseka, gakahumila mang'ung'uta pagati ya vamsadika va Yesu, Vayawudi vevilongela Chigiliki vala na vala vevilongela Chiebulania, vevilongela Chigiliki vala vang'ung'utayi ndava vakuvakosiwa valipwela vavi mukugawiwa vyakulya vya kila ligono. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ndi muni, vamitumi kumi na vavili vala vakavakemela vamsadika, vakajova, “Chabwina lepi tete kuleka kukokosa Linenu la Chapanga na kuvagavila chakulya. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Hinu, valongo vitu, mvahagula vandu saba pagati yinu, vevitopeswa na vevamemili Mpungu Msopi na luhala, tete yati tikuvagotolela lihengu lenili. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Tavete yati tivya mukuhenga mukumuyupa Chapanga na lihengu la kukokosa Linenu la Chapanga.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Lijambu lenilo likavaganisa vamsadika voha, ndi vakavahagula Stefani, mundu mweamemiswi sadika yivaha na Mpungu Msopi na Filipi na Plokolo na Timoni na Pamena na Nikolausi mundu wa ku Antiokia mweajiwungi na njila ya kumuyupa Chapanga ya Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Vakavavika palongolo ya vamitumi, kangi vakavayupila kwa Chapanga kuni vavapamisi mawoko.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Linenu la Chapanga likadandasika ku Yelusalemu na vamsadika vakayonjokeseka neju, chikundi chivaha cha vamteta va Chapanga vakalanda sadika.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukamuliwa kwa Stefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Hinu, Stefani amotisiwi na apewili makakala na Chapanga, hati akahenga chinamtiti na makangaso pagati ya vandu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Nambu vandu vangi vakahumila muni vahutana na Stefani. Vandu venavo vavi va “Nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi la vandu Hulu,” Vene vahumili Kulene na Alekisanda, na vangi vahumili Kilikia na Asia. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Nambu vahotwili lepi kumhotola ndava ya luhala lwaki, na Mpungu Msopi mweamlongwisi mukujova. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ndi vakavakulukisa cha mfiyu vandu nunuyu vajova kuvya, “Timyuwini Stefani akumliga Musa na akumliga Chapanga.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Ndava ya yeniyo, vakavakokesa vandu, vachilongosi na vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa. Ndi vakambwelela Stefani vakamkamula na kumpeleka palongolo ya libanji. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Kangi vakaleta vajova malovi ga udesi vevajovili, “Mundu uyu katu ikotoka lepi kuliga pandu apa Pamsopi na kuliga malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Ndava muni tamali kumyuwanila kuvya Yesu wa ku Nazaleti mwenuyu yati apagwisa pandu apa na kung'anamusa mivelu yila yetapokili kuhuma kwa Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Voha vevatamili mu libanji lila vakamlolokesa takataka Stefani, kangi vakalola pamihu paki pavi ngati mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Makokoso ga Stefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Kangi, Mteta Mkulu akamkota, “Wu, mambu genaga ndi chakaka?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Mwene akayangula, “Valongo vangu na vadadi vangu, muniyuwanila! Chapanga amuhumalili gogo witu Ibulahimu peavili ku Mesopotamia kwakona kuhamila ku Halani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Chapanga akamjovela, ‘Wuka pamulima waku, valeka valongo vaku, ndi uhamba pamulima wenikulangisa.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Hinu, Ibulahimu ahamalili kumulima wa Kalidayo akahamba kutama ku Halani. Dadi waki peamali kufwa, Chapanga akamuwusa kavili ku Halani akabwela kutama pamulima uwu wemwitama hinu. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Chapanga nakumpela hati pandu padebe pamulima pavyaa uhali waki, nambu amlagizi akumpela mulima wenuwu uvyaa waki, na chiveleku chaki. Lukumbi lwenulo avi lepi na mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Chapanga akamjovela, ‘Viveleku vyaku yati vipelekwa kumulima wa vandu vangi, kwenuko ndi yati vivya vavanda na kuhengewa uhakau mulukumbi lwa miyaka miya mcheche. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Nambu nene yati nikuvahamula vandu avo, vevavahengili uvanda. Kangi yati nikuvawusa mumulima wenuwo muni vabwela penapa kunifugamila pandu apa.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Kangi Chapanga akampela lilaganu la jandu, Ibulahimu akamyingisa jandu mwana waki Izaki mu ligono la nane, kuhuma kuvelekewa. Mewawa Izaki akamdumula jandu Yakobo, namwene Yakobo mewawa akavakitila vagogo kumi na vavili.”<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Vagogo vala vavi na wihu kwa Yosefu ndi vakamgulisa kuuvanda ku Misili. Nambu Chapanga avi pamonga nayu, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />akamsangula mu mang'ahiso gaki goha, Chapanga akamganisa na luhala palongolo ya Falao, nkosi wa ku Misili, hati Falao akamhagula kuvya chilongosi wa mulima wula na nyumba ya nkosi. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Kangi yikahumila njala yikulu, pamulima woha wa ku Misili na ku Kanani, yikaleta ungangu uvaha. Vagogo vitu vahotwili lepi kupata chakulya chochoha. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Hinu, Yakobo peayuwini kuvya ku Misili kula kuvi na mabenu, akavatuma vana vaki, ndi vagogo vitu vahamba kwenuko yavi mala ya kutumbula. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Mulugendu lwavi lwa pili, Yosefu akajimanyisa kwa valongo vaki, ndi Falao akavamanya valongo va Yosefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yosefu atumili ujumbi kwa dadi waki na valongo vaki, vandu sabini na mhanu, vabwela ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Hinu, Yakobo ahambili ku Misili, kwenuko mwene pamonga na vagogo vitu vafwili. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Higa zavi zaletiwi mbaka ku Shekemu, zikazikiwa mu litinda la mbugu leagulili Ibulahimu kuhuma kwa vana va Hamoli kwa mashonga nunuyu.”<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Lukumbi palwahikili Chapanga atimilisa lilaganu leajovili akumpela Ibulahimu, ku Misili kula vandu vayonjokisi na kuvya vamahele neju. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Pamwishu, nkosi mmonga mweanga mmanya Yosefu, akatumbula kulongosa kula ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Mwenuyu avakitili uhakau vandu vitu na vagogo vitu changali kugana vene vavavika kuvala vana vavi vadebe muni vafwayi. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Musa avelekiwi lukumbi lwenulo, avili mwana mbwina neju palongolo ya Chapanga. Aleliwi panyumba mulukumbi lwa miyehi yidatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />na peaumiswi kuvala, ndi msikana wa Falao akamtola na kumlela ngati mwana waki mwene. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa awuliwi mambu goha galuhala ga Vamisili akavya mkekesi kwa malovi na matendu.”<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Hinu Musa peahikisi miyaka alobaini ndi akahamba kuvagendela kuvalola va Isilaeli vayaki. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Kwenuko amuwene mmonga wa valongo vaki ihengewa uhakau, ndi akahamba kumkengelela, ndi akamkoma Mmisili yula. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Aholalili manya Vaisilaeli vayaki yati vimanya kuvya Chapanga ngaamtumili mwene kuvagombola, nambu vene nakugamanya ago. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Chilalu yaki Musa avawene Vaisilaeli vavili vitovana, akalinga kuvatepulanisa akavajovela, ‘Nyenye mwavalongo ndava kyani hinu, mukomana mwavene?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Nambu yungi mweamtovayi yula muyaki akamkang'a Musa pamuhana akajova, ‘Yani mweakuvikili veve kuvya chilongosi na mhamula pagati yitu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Wu, ugana kunikoma ngati chewamkomili Mmisili golo?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Musa peagayuwini malovi ago, akatila na kuhamba kutama kumulima wa Midiani kwenuko akavya myehe ndi akavya na vana vasongolo vavili.”<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Peyahikili miyaka alobaini, mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamhumila Musa padahi pepiyaka motu kulugangatu papipi na Chitumbi cha Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa akakangasa kulola lijambu lenilo hati akahegelela papipi muni alingulila, ndi akayuwana lwami lwa Bambu. <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Nene ndi Chapanga wa vagogo vaku, Chapanga wa Ibulahimu wa Izaki na Yakobo.’ Musa akavagaya kwa wogohi ndi nakuhotola kulolokesa neju. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Bambu akamjovela, ‘Hula champali zaku muni peuyima apa ndi pandu pamsopi. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nigawene mahakau gevihengiwa vandu vangu ku Misili kula. Niyuwini lwami lwa mang'ahiso gavi, ndi nene nibweli kuvagombola. Hinu bwela, yati nikukutuma ku Misili.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Musa mwenuyu ndi yula mweabeleliwi na vandu va Isilaeli pavamjovili, ‘Yani mweakuvikili kuvya chilongosi na mhamula pagati yitu?’ Chapanga amtumili Musa kuvya chilongosi na mgombozi, kwa njila ya mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga mweamhumalili padahi pepiyaka motu. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ndi mweavalongwisi vandu vala vawuka ku Misili kwa kuhenga ulangisu wa gachinamtiti na makangaso pamulima wa Misili na Kunyanja ya Shamu na kulugangatu, mulukumbi lwa miyaka alobaini. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa ndi mweavajovili vandu va Isilaeli, ‘Chapanga yati akuvahagulila mlota waki ngati nene pagati ya valongo vinu mwavene.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Mwene ndi mweavili kulugangatu kula, pevakonganiki vandu va Isilaeli. Musa avili ngati mjumbi pagati ya vagogo vitu, na mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga, lukumbi pealongili nayu kuchitumbi cha Sinai ndi mweagotoliwi malovi ga wumi atijovela tete.”<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Nambu vagogo vitu ndi vabelili kumyidakila, ndi vakamkang'a pamuhana kuni mumitima yavi vakanogela kuwuya ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Vakamjovela mlongo wa Musa Aloni, ‘Utikitila vachapanga yeyikutulongosa munjila, muni nakumanya chechimkolili Musa mweatilongwisi kuhuma ku Misili!’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Penapo ndi pavajikitili chimong'omong'o cha mpapakasi wa ng'ombi, vakayitetela na vakakita mselebuko ndava ya lihengu la mawoko gavi vene. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Nambu Chapanga akawuka pagati yavi na kuvaleka vazifugundamila ndondo za kunani, ngati cheyiyandikwi muhitabu ya vamlota va Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Nyenye vandu va Isilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">Lepi nene mwemwanihinjili hinyama ndava ya luteta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">Mumiyaka alobaini kulugangatu kula!<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Nyenye mwagegili chindanda cha chapanga Moloki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">na vindu vyemwajikitili kwa luhumu lwa ndondo ya chapanga winu Lefani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Vindu vyemwajikitili ndi vyemwavifugamili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Ndava ya yeniyo yati nikuvapeleka uvanda kutali na Babeli.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Kulugangatu kula vagogo vitu vavi na lindanda la kulangisa, lakitiwi ngati Chapanga cheamlagazili Musa ahengayi, ulangisu wulawula ngati weauwene. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Kangi Vagogo vitu vahalilini lindanda vene kwa vene mbaka lukumbi lwa Yoshua, pevatolili mulima wula kuhuma kwa milima, Chapanga mweavingili palongolo yavi. Penapo ndi latamili mbaka lusenje lwa Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Daudi apewili uganu na Chapanga, akamuyupa ayidakila amujengela pandu pa kutama, mwene mweavi Chapanga wa Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Nambu Solomoni ndi mweamjengili Chapanga nyumba.”<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Nambu Chapanga Mkulu, itama lepi munyumba zezijengiwi na vandu ngati cheajovili mlota wa Chapanga,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Bambu ijova, kunani ndi chigoda changu cha unkosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na mulima ndi chigoda cha kuvikila magendelu gangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Nyumba ya namuna yoki yemukunijengela nene?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Ndi pandu poki penipumulila?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Namwene ndi mwenihengili vindu vyoha?’ ”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Nyenye vandu mwemwinonopa, mitima na makutu ginu ndi ngati vandu va milima yangamulanda Chapanga. Nyenye ngati vagogo vinu. Magono goha mukumbela Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Vagogo vinu vamng'aisi mlota wa Chapanga yeyoha yula, vevavakomili avo, Chapanga avatumili kukokosa kubwela kwa yula mweikita geigana Chapanga. Nambu nyenye mwamgewukili na kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Nyenye mwapokili malagizu gala gegaletiwi na mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga, nambu mwayidakili lepi.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stefani ikomiwa na maganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Vala vagogo va libanji pavamuyuwanili Stefani, vakaviniswa mitima, ndi vakajiluma minu cha ligoga. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Nambu Stefani kuni amemiswi Mpungu Msopi, akalolokesa kunani kwa Chapanga, auwene ukulu wa Chapanga na Yesu ayimili muchiwoko cha kulyela cha Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Stefani akajova, “Mlola! Niwona kunani kwa Chapanga kudindwiki na Mwana wa Mundu ayimili pachiwoko cha kulyela cha Chapanga!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Vakulu va libanji, vakaywanga na vakagubika makutu gavi kwa mawoko. Kangi vakamuhumbila voha kwa pamonga. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Vakamkwekwesa kuvala ya muji, na kutumbula kumtova na maganga, vevavawene vakagavika makoti gavi paulonda wa msongolo mmonga liina laki Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Pevayendalili kumtova na maganga Stefani kuni mwene iyupa kwa Chapanga, “Bambu Yesu upokela mpungu wangu!”<figure style="fig" file="19 Being Stoned.jpg" size="col" ref="7:59">Mundu itovewa maganga mbaka kufwa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Akafugama, akavemba kwa lwami luvaha, “Bambu, ukotoka kuvavalangila chevakubudila Chapanga!” Peamalili kujova ago, akafwa. Sauli ayidakili chitendu cha ukomaji wenuwo.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="s">Sauli itumbula kuvang'aha vamsadika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Na mwene Sauli awene chabwina kukomewa kwa Sitefani. Ligono lenilo msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Yelusalemu, vatumbwili kung'ahiswa neju. Vamsadika voha, Yavaganili kupechenganika kudahi pandi za ku Yudea na ku Samaliya, nambu kwa vamitumi ndu. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Vandu vevisadika vakamuzika Stefani na kumvembela neju.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Nambu lukumbi lwenulo Sauli alingili kuvang'aisa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu, ahambili nyumba kwa nyumba akavahumisa vamsadika kuvala vagosi kwa vadala na kuvasopa muchifungu.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Linenu la Bwina likokoswa ku Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Hinu vala vamsadika vevapechangini vakahamba kila pandu kukokosa Linenu la Bwina. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipi namwene akahelela pamuji wa ku Samaliya na kumkokosa Kilisitu kwa vakolonjinji va penapo. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Vandu vakajiwunga kuyuwanila ujumbi wa Filipi na kulola milangisu yila yeahenga. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Ndava muni vandu vevatalaliwi mizuka mihakau, yavahumili kwa lwami luvaha, vandu vevapolili higa na vangagenda valamisiwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Kwavili na luheku luvaha pamuji wenuwo.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Hinu pamuji wenuwo kwavili na mundu mmonga liina laki Simoni, mweakitili uhavi waki, pamuji wenuwu na kuvakangasa vandu va ku Samaliya, akujikwiha kuvya mwene ndi mweitopela, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />na vandu voha vadebe na vavaha, vamyuwanili hotohoto vakajova, “Simoni ndi makakala ga uchapanga gegikemelewa ‘Makakala gavaha.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Vamlandili ndava avakangisi kwa lukumbi lutali ndava ya uhavi waki. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Nambu pavasadiki ujumbi wa Filipi kulivala Linenu la Bwina la Unkosi wa Chapanga na kuyuwana makokoso ga Yesu Kilisitu, vagosi na vadala vabatiziwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Hati Simoni mwene, asadiki na peamali kubatiziwa, akalongosana na Filipi, akakangasa makangaso na gachinamtiti geahengili.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Vamitumi vala vevavili ku Yelusalemu, pevayuwini kuvya vakolonjinji va ku Samaliya vayidakili Linenu la Chapanga, ndi vakavatuma kwenuko Petili na Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Hinu pavahikili vakavayupila kwa Chapanga vamsadika vala, muni vampokela Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Ndava lukumbi lwenulo Mpungu Msopi avi akona kuvahelelela yeyoha pagati yavi, nambu vamali kubatiziwa paliina la Bambu Yesu ndu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Kangi Petili na Yohani vakavavikila mawoko gavi vamsadika, navene mewa vampokili Mpungu Msopi.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Hinu Simoni pealoli kuvya mukuvikiwa mawoko na vamitumi, vamsadika vampokili Mpungu Msopi. Alingili kuvapela mashonga Petili na Yohani, akajova, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />“Mnipela na nene uhotola wenuwo muni nakamvikila mawoko mundu yeyoha, apokela Mpungu Msopi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Nambu Petili akamyangula, “Fwila kulongolo na mashonga gaku ndava wihololela kuvya wihotola kugula makakala ga Chapanga kwa mashonga! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Veve uvi lepi na lilundu amala pandu popoha mulihengu ili, muni mtima waku uganisa lepi palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ndava muni, umuwuyila Chapanga waku kwa kukotoka uhakau waku, kavili umuyupa Bambu mwene ihotola kukulekekesa maholo ngati ago. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Nikulola hotohoto umelili wihu neju, ndi mkungiwa wa kumbudila Chapanga.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni akayangula, “Chondi, muniyupilayi kwa Bambu, likoto kunikolela hati limonga pagati ya ago gemujovili.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Petili na Yohani pevamalili kujova malovi gavi ga kukokosa ujumbi wa Bambu, vakawuya ku Yelusalemu. Hinu pavavi mukuwuya vakakokosa Linenu la Bwina muhijiji yamahele ya ku Samaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipi akumbatiza myimilila lihengu mmonga wa ku Ethiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamjovela Filipi, “Jitendelekela uhamba kusini kupitila njila yeyihuma ku Yelusalemu mbaka ku Gaza.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Filipi peamali kujitendelekela, akatumbula lugendu lwa kuhamba Yelusalemu. Lukumbi lwenulo kwavili na mkolonjinji mmonga wa ku Ethiopia. Avi mvika mashonga wa Kandake, nkosi wa Chidala wa ku Ethiopia. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Mweavili munjila kuwuya kunyumba kuhuma ku Yelusalemu kweahambili kumlumba Chapanga, atamili mumkokoteni wa kubiluswa kuni ajisomelayi kwa lwami chitabu cha mlota wa Chapanga Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Mpungu Msopi akamjovela Filipi, “Hamba papipi na mkokoteni wenuwo ulongosana nayu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipi akajumbalila papipi na mkokoteni wula, akamyuwana mundu yula isoma muchitabu cha mlota wa Chapanga Isaya. Penapo Filipi akamkota, “Wu, ukuchimanya chewisoma?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Mundu yula akamyangula, “Nihotola wuli kumanya changali mundu kunidandaulila?” Ndi akamgongolela Filipi akwela mumkokoteni wula na kutama pamonga na mwene. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Pandu pa Mayandiku Gamsopi peasomayi vayandiki aga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Avi ngati limbelele lelihamba kuhinjwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">chinunu ngati mwana limbelele cheidumuliwa mangoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">nakuyahamula mlomo.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Akoliwi soni na kunotewa chechikumvala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Avi lepi wa kuhotola kulongela ndava ya mundu yoyoha chaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">muni wumi waki uwusiwi pamulima.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Muyimila hindu yula akamkota Filipi, “Nijovela, mlota wa Chapanga uyu ijova mambu aga ndava yaki mwene, amala ndava ya mundu yungi?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Hinu Filipi akatumbula pandu pa Mayandiku Gamsopi ago, akamjovela Linenu la Bwina ndava ya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Pevavi vakona munjila, vakahika pandu pepavi na manji ndi mundu yula akajova, “Pandu apa pana manji, wu, chivii chindu kiki chechikunibesa nene kubatiziwa?”<figure style="fig" file="20 Baptism.jpg" size="col" ref="8:36">Mundu ibatiziwa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipi akajova, “Ngati wisadika kwa mutima waku woha wihotola kubatiziwa.” Namwene akajova, “Nisadika Yesu Kilisitu ndi Mwana wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Hinu myimila hindu yula akahamula mkokoteni wa kubiluswa wula uyima, Filipi na mwene vakahuluka mumanji ndi Filipi akambatiza. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Pavahumili mumanji Mpungu wa Bambu amkitili Filipi awuka, myimilila hindu akotoka kumlola kavili, nambu mwene akayendelela na lugendu lwaki kuni avi na luheku. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Nambu Filipi akahumila ku Azoto, na munjila avi mukukokosa Linenu la Bwina mbaka peahikili ku Kaisalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Kusadika kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Matendu 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Nambu lukumbi lwenulo, Sauli ayonjokisi kuvayogofya kwa kuvakoma vamulanda va Bambu. Akahamba kwa Mteta Mkulu, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />akayupa balua ya kummanyisa kwa nyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi zezavi ku Damasko, muni akavakolela vandu vevilanda Njila ya Bambu, vagosi amala vadala, avakamula na kuvaleta ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Sauli peavi munjila papipi kuhika ku Damasko, chigafula lumuli kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga lukamtindila kumlangasa mwene pandi zoha. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Sauli akagwa pahi ndi akayuwana lwami lukumjovela, “Sauli, Sauli! Ndava kyani ukuning'aha?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sauli akakota, “Ndi wayani veve, Bambu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Na lwami lula lukayangula, “Nene ndi Yesu mweukuning'aha. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Nambu hinu yima uhamba kumujini, kwenuko ndi kwewijoviwa chechikugana kuchihenga.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Vandu vevavi mulugendu pamonga na Sauli vayimili nuu ndava ya kukangaswa, vayuwini lwami lula nambu vamuwene lepi mundu yoyoha. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sauli akayinuka, peagubukwili mihu gaki, nakuhotola kulola, hinu vandu vevavi mulugendu nawu vakamkamula chiwoko kumlongosa mbaka ku Damasko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Sauli atamili magono gadatu changalola, na lukumbi lwenulo lwoha atamii changalya chindu amala kunywa chindu chochoha.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Damasko kula ndi kwavili na msadika mmonga liina laki Anania. Mwenuyo akemeliwi kujovewa na Bambu mumawono, “Anania!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Mwene akayidika, “Nivii apa, Bambu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mwene Bambu akamjovela, “Ujitendelekahi uhamba kunjila yeyikemelewa Selede mbaka kunyumba ya Yuda ukotayi kumvala mundu yula mweahumili ku Taso, liina laki Sauli. Hinu akumuyupa Chapanga, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />na Sauli amali kuloleswa mumaono na Bambu, kuvya mundu mweikemiwa Anania avi kuyingila mugati na kumvikila mawoko muni alola kavili.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Nambu Anania akayangula, “Bambu, vandu vamahele nivayuwini mambu gakumvala mundu uyu, niyuwini gahakau neju geavahengili vamsadika vaku ku Yelusalemu kula. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Na hinu vamteta vakulu vampeli uhotola Sauli abwela kuni ku Damasko kuvakamula voha vevakukusadika veve.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Nambu Bambu akamjovela Anania, “Uhamba ndu, muni mwenuyo nimuhagwili muni anihengela, kukokosa ndava ya liina langu kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi na vankosi vavi na kwa vandu va Isilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Namwene yati nikumlangisa mambu gamahele gegakumgana kung'aiswa ndava yangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Hinu Anania akahamba mbaka panyumba yeniyo, akayingila mugati, kangi akamvikila mawoko Sauli. Akamjovela “Mlongo Sauli, Bambu Yesu ndi mweanitumili, mwene akuhumalili pawakavili munjila kubwela kuni, anitumili nene muni uhotola kulola kavili na kumemeswa Mpungu Msopi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Bahapo vindu ngati magagau vikagwa pahi kuhuma mumihu mwa Sauli, ndi akalola kavili. Hinu akayima, akabatiziwa, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />na peamali kulya chakulya makakala gaki gakamuwuyila.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli ikokosa ku Damasko</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli atamili pamonga na vawuliwa magono gadebe ku Damasko kula. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Bahapo akatumbula kukokosa munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi, kuvya Yesu ndi Mwana wa Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Vandu voha vevamyuwini vakakangasa, vakakota, “Wu, mundu mwenuyu lepi yula mweavakomili vandu vala vevamuyupayi kwa liina la Yesu wa ku Yelusalemu? Na ndava ya mpangu wenuwo ndi abwela penapa, avakamula vandu na kuvapeleka kwa vamteta vakulu!”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Sauli akayonjokeseka ukekesi na makakala, ndava ya kujova hotohoto kuvya Yesu ndi Kilisitu, Vayawudi va ku Damasko luhala lukavayaga.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Pagamaliki magono gamahele, Vayawudi vakakonganeka na kukita mpangu wa kumkoma Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Nambu Sauli ayuwini mpangu wavi. Kilu na muhi vamlindili mumilyangu ya kuyingalila kumujini muni vahotola kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Lukumbi lwa kilu vawuliwa vaki vakamtola na kumhulusa pahi mugati ya lidengu livaha mufwasi ya luwumba.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli iwuya ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sauli pahaikili ku Yelusalemu akalinga kujiwunga na vawuliwa vala. Nambu vandu voha vamyogwipi vamsadiki lepi kuvya mwene ndi mulanda wa chakaka. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Kangi Banaba akamtola Sauli na kumpeleka kwa vamitumi, akavadandaulila kumvala Sauli cheamuwene Bambu munjila, na Bambu chealongili nayu. Mewawa avadandaulili kuvya Sauli cheahotwili kukokosa muuhotola wa Yesu changali wogohi, ku Damasko kula. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Hinu Sauli akatama pamonga nawu, akagendelela pa Yelusalemu poha kuni ikokosa liina la Bambu changali wogohi. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Mewawa alongili na kuhutana na Vayawudi vevilongela Chigiliki, nambu vene vapangili kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Valongo vala pevayuwini mpangu wenuwo, vakamtola Sauli na kuhamba nayu ku Kaisalia ndi vakamtuma ahamba ku Taso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Lukumbi lwenulo msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vakavya na uteke na mumiji yoha ya ku Yudea na ku Galilaya na ku Samaliya. Layendalili kukula mukuyupa Bambu na kuyonjokeseka na kutangatiliwa na Mpungu Msopi.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili ku Luda na ku Yopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petili peavi mulugendu kila pandi mewa avahikilili vandu va Chapanga vevatamayi kumuji wa Luda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Kwenuko akamkolili mundu mmonga liina laki Ainea mweavi na utamu wa kupola higa, ndi agonili pa mpasa mulukumbi lwa miyaka nane. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petili akamjovela, “Ainea, Yesu Kilisitu akukulamisa. Yimuka, ujitandikila mpasa waku.” Bahapo Ainea akayima. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Vandu voha va ku Luda na ku Saloni pavawene Ainea, vakamuwuyila Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Kumuji wa Yopa kwavili na mulanda mmonga mdala liina laki Tabita, kwa Chigiliki ndi Doka mana yaki huluku. Mdala mwenuyo ahengayi mambu ga kumganisa Chapanga na kuvatangatila vangangu. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Magono genago alwalili na kufwa. Hinu vandu vayisambisi higa yaki, vakamgonesa kugolofa. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Muji wa Luda wavi papipi na muji wa Yopa, hinu vamsadika vala pevayuwini kuvya Petili avi kwenuko, ndi vakavatuma vandu vavili na ujumbi uwu, “Chondi, ubwela kwitu kanyata.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Hinu, Petili akawuka na kulongosana na vajumbi vala, pevamali kuhika vampeliki kugolofa. Valipwela voha vevavi penapo vamtindili Petili vakavembeneka na kumlangisa magwanda na nyula zoha zeatengenezayi Doka pavi mumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petili avahumisi kuvala vandu voha akafugama akayupa kwa Chapanga. Kangi akahegelela payavi higa pala na kujova, “Tabita, yumuka!” Mwene akagubukula mihu, hinu peamuwene Petili ndi akayinuka na kutama. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petili akamkamula chiwoko, akamyinula. Kangi akavakemela vamsadika na valipwela vala ndi akavagotolela kuni avi mumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Malovi ga lijambu lenilo gadandasiki pandu poha ku Yopa, na vandu vamahele vakamsadika Bambu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petili atamili ku Yopa kwa magono nunuyu, munyumba ya mundu mweitendelekela vindu vya chikumba liina laki Simoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petili na Kolineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Pamuji wa Kaisalia kwavili na mundu mmonga liina laki Kolineli, mwene avi mkulu wa manjolinjoli va chikundi chechikemelewa “Msambi wa Italia.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Mwene avi mundu mbwina, mwene pamonga na lukolo lwaki voha vamuyupayi Chapanga. Ahengayi mambu gamahele ga kuvatangatila vangangu va Vayawudi na kumuyupa Chapanga magono goha. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ligono limonga lukumbi lwa saa tisa ya muhi awene maono hotohoto, Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akumbwelela na kumjovela, “Kolineli!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kolineli akamlolokesa takataka cha wogohi Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga yula, ndi akamkota “Chivii kyani Bambu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamyangula, “Chapanga ayuwini kumuyupa kwaku na aganisiwi na kuvatangatila kwaku vangangu ndi akukumbwiki. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Hinu, uvatumayi vandu ku Yopa vakamtola mundu mmonga liina laki Simoni. Ndi mewa ikemelewa Petili. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Mwene ndi myehe munyumba ya Simoni, mundu mweitendelekela vindu vya chikumba. Nyumba yaki yivii pamuhana ya nyanja.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga yula peawukili, Kolineli akavakemela vatumisi vavili va nyumba na mmonga wa manjolinjoli vaki mweakumyidakila Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Peavadandaulili mambu goha gegahumalili, akavatuma ku Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Chilau yaki, lukumbi lwa saa sita ya muhi, vandu avo vadatu mulugendu lwavi, papipi kuhika ku Yopa, Petili akakwela kunani ya nyumba kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Njala yamvinili, akanogela kulya. Nambu chakulya pachatendelekewayi mwene akalola maono. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Awene kunani kwa Chapanga kudinduliwi na chindu ngati shuka yivaha yihuluswa pahi, kuni yikamuliwi pandi zoha mcheche za mulima. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Na mugati ya shuka yila mwavi hinyama ndalindali, hinyama ya magendelu mcheche na hinyama yeyilandala pamulima na videge vyevimbululuka. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Akayuwana lwami lukumjovela, “Petili, yimuka hinja na ulyayi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Nambu Petili akamyangula, “Lepi Bambu! Nene katu niwonjili lepi chindu chochoha changayidakiliwa kulya.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Nambu lwami lula lukamuyila kavili, “Lukamjovela vindu vyeaviyidakiliwi na Chapanga kulya, kotoka kuvikelamela vihakau.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Lijambu lila lahengiki mala zidatu, kangi shuka yivaha yila yikawuyiswa kanyata kunani kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petili peavi akona ikangasa maono gala mana yaki kyani, hinu vandu vala vevatumwili na Kolineli pevamanyiswi nyumba ya Simoni, vakahika pamlyangu. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Vakahodisa kwa lwami, “Vakakota kuvya kuna myehe mweitama apa ikemiwa Simoni Petili?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petili pealinga kuhololela mana ya maono gala, Mpungu Msopi akamjovela, “Yuwanila! Vavi vandu vadatu vakukulonda. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Huluka kanyata na ulongosana nawu kuhamba changali mtahu, muni nene ndi mwenivatumili.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Hinu, Petili akahuluka pahi, akavajovela vandu vala, “Mwemukunilonda ndi nene. Ndava kyani munibwelili?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Vene vakamyangula, atitumili “Kolineli mkulu wa manjolinjoli, mundu mbwina, mweakumuyupa Chapanga, itopeswa na Vayawudi. Ajoviwi na mtumu wa Kunani kwa Chapanga akumgongolela kunyumba yaki, muni ayuwana chochoha chila cheukumjovela.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Petili akavakemela mugati mula, akavapela pandu pa kugona kilu yila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Chilau yaki, Petili akatumbula lugendu pamonga nawu. Vamsadika vangi vevatamayi ku Yopa vakalongosana. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ndi pamalau yaki vakahika pamuji wa Kaisalia. Kolineli avi mukuvalindila mwene na vanalukolo lwaki pamonga na vankozi veavagongolili. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petili peavi mukuyingila Kolineli akahamba kumkumbatila cha uganu, akamfugamila mumagendelu gaki akamgundamila. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Nambu Petili akamuyinula, akamjovela, “Yima, muni nene namundu ngati veve.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Petili na Kolineli viyingila mugati, kuni vilongela ndi vavakolili vandu vamahele vakonganiki. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Petili akavajovela, “Mwavene mmanyi hotohoto, kuvya Myawudi abesiwi na malagizu kwa njila ya kumuyupa Chapanga yaki kutangatilana na mundu angali kuvya Myawudi, amala kumgendela nambu Chapanga anilangisi nene kuvya nakuyidakiliwa kumkemela mundu yoyoha iganikiwa lepi amala mhakau. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ndava ya yeniyo, pamwakanikemili nibweli changali mtahu. Hinu munijovela munikemelili kyani?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kolineli akayangula, “Magono gadatu gamumbele, lukumbi lwa saa tisa ya muhi, nene navi muchumba changu kumuyupa Chapanga. Chigafula namuwene mundu mweawalili nyula zezing'asima neju, ayimili palongolo yangu, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />anijovili, Kolineli! Chapanga ayuwini chewiyupa pamonga na teta zaku kwa vangangu. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Hinu uvatuma vandu vahamba ku Yopa, vakamkemela mundu mmonga liina laki Simoni mweikemelewa mewa Petili. Mwenuyo avili kunyumba ya Simoni, mundu mweitendelekela vindu vya chikumba, nyumba yaki yivii pamumhana ya nyanja. <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ndi kanyata navatumili vajumbi kwaku, wamwene ukitili chabwina kubwela. Tavoha apa tivii palongolo ya Chapanga, ndava ya kukuyuwanila chindu chochoha cheakulagizi Bambu utijovela.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makokosa ga Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Kangi Petili akatumbula kujova, “Hinu nimanyili kuvya Chapanga ibagula lepi. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Nambu mundu yeyoha mumulima mweiyupa na kuhenga gakumganisa Chapanga yati iyidakiliwa namwene. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Umanyili ujumbi wula Chapanga weavapelekili vandu va ku Isilaeli, ikokosa Linenu la Bwina lelileta uteke kwa njila ya Yesu Kilisitu mwene ndi Bambu wa voha. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mwavene mumanyili lijambu lelahumalili pamulima woha wa Vayawudi kutumbula ku Galilaya Yohani peamali kukokosa ndava ya ubatizu. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Mwimanya kuvya Chapanga cheamhagwili Yesu wa ku Nazaleti, ndi akammemesa Mpungu Msopi na kumpela makakala. Chapanga avi pamonga nayu, mwene ahambili kila pandu kuhenga gabwina na kuvalamisa vandu voha vevang'aiswi na Setani. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Tavete tagawene mambu goha geagahengili pamulima wa Vayawudi na muji wa ku Yelusalemu. Vamkomili na kumvamba munjila ya msalaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Nambu Chapanga amyukisi pagamaliki magono gadatu kuhuma kwa vevafwili. Akaloleka hotohoto, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />awonikini lepi kwa vandu voha, nambu kwa tete ndu tetamali kuhaguliwi na Chapanga kuvya vetagawene. Ndi tete vetalili na kunywelela pamonga nayu peamali kuyuka kwaki. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Atilagazili kuvakokosela vandu voha Linenu la Bwina na kuvajovela kuvya mwene ndi mweahaguliwi na Chapanga, kuvya mhamula wa vandu vevavili mumi na vandu vevafwili. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Vamlota voha va Chapanga vijova ndava yaki kuvya mundu yoyoha mweakumsadika Yesu, yati ilekekeswa kumbudila Chapanga, paliina laki.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolineli na valongo vaki vakumpokela Mpungu Msopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Petili pavi akona ilongela malovi ago, Mpungu Msopi akavahelelela vandu voha vevayuwanila ujumbi wula. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Vayawudi vamsadika vevabweli pamonga na Petili kuhuma ku Yopa, vakangisi kulola Chapanga avamemisi njombi ya Mpungu Msopi vandu vangali Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Muni vavayuwini vilongela kwa muluga za chiyehe kuni vakumulumbalila Chapanga. Kangi Petili akajova, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Vandu ava vampokili Mpungu Msopi ngati tete. Wu, avi mundu yoyoha, mweakuvabesa vakotoka kubatiziwa na manji?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ndi akalagiza vabatiziwa kwa uhotola wa Yesu Kilisitu, kangi vakamuyupa Petili atama nawu magono nunuyu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Malovi ga Petili kwa vamsadika va ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Vamitumi na vamsadika nunuyu vevavi ku Yudea vayuwini kuvya vandu vangali Vayawudi navene mewa vapokili Linenu la Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Hinu Petili, peawuyili ku Yelusalemu, vamsadika va Vayawudi vala vevaganisiwi kuvya vandu vangali Vayawudi vevadumwili jandu. Ndi vakang'ung'uta vakajova, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Veve uhambili kutama na vandu vanga yingila jandu na hati kulya pamonga nawu!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Penapo Petili akavadandaulila hotohoto kugavala mambu gala gegahengiki.<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Ligono limonga namuyupayi Chapanga kumuji wa Yopa, nagawene maono, nachiwene chindu ngati shuka yivaha yihuluswa pahi kuhuma Kunani kwa Chapanga, kuni yikamuliwi pandi zoha mcheche, yavikiwi pamuhana yangu. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Panakalingulili bwina mugati naloli hinyama ya magendelu mcheche, na hinyama ya mudahi na hinyama yeyilandala pamulima na hidege yeyimbululuka. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Kangi nayuwini lwami lukunijovela, ‘Petili, yimuka uhinja na kulya.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Nambu nene nikajova, ‘Lepi Bambu, muni chakulya chochoha changayidakiliwa katu nakuyingila hati padebe mumlomo wangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Nambu lwami lwa Kunani kwa Chapanga lwayuwaniki kavili, ‘Nakuvikelema vyangayidakiliwa vyakulya vyeavinyambisi Chapanga.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Lijambu lenilo lahengiki mala yidatu, pamwishu vindu vyoha vikawuyiswa Kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Chigafula vandu vadatu kuhuma Kaisalia vevatumiwi kubwela kwangu vakahika panyumba mwenatamayi. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Mpungu Msopi akanijovela nihamba pamonga nawu changali mtahu. Vamsadika ava sita nalongosini nawu kuhamba Kaisalea na kwenuko tavoha tayingili munyumba ya Kolineli. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Mwene atijovili namuna cheamuwene mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga, cheamuhumili munyumba yaki na kumjovela, ‘Tuma vajumbi vahamba ku Yopa vakamkemela mundu mmonga liina laki Simoni paliina lingi Petili. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Mwene yati akukujovela malovi gegakusangula veve pamonga na valongo vaku.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Panatumbwili kulongela, Mpungu Msopi avahelili ngati cheatumbwili kutihelela tete. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Kangi nakumbwiki malovi geajovili Bambu, ‘Yohani abatizi kwa manji nambu nyenye yati mwibatiziwa kwa Mpungu Msopi.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Hinu ngati Chapanga avapelili njombi vandu vangali Vayawudi ngati cheatipelili tete tetamsadiki Bambu Yesu Kilisitu, wu, nayani nene hati nilinga kumbesa Chapanga?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Pevagayuwini malovi ago, vakaleka mhutanu, vakamlumba Chapanga, mukujova, “Kumbi! Chapanga avapeli fwasi vandu vangali Vayawudi vamuwuyila mwene vapata wumi!”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamsadika va ku Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Kangi, ndava ya mang'ahiso gegahumalili lukumbi Stefani ikomiwa, vamsadika vapechengini. Vangi vakahamba mbaka Foinike vangi Kuplo na vangi ku Antiokia mukukokosa ujumbi wula kwa Vayawudi ndu. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Nambu vamsadika vangi vevahumili Kuplo na Kulene, vakahambili ku Antiokia vakakokosa ujumbi wenuwo kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi, vakokosayi Linenu la Bwina la kumvala Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Bambu avatangatili na vandu vamahele vasadiki na kumuwuyila Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Malovi ga lijambu lila lahikili msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Yelusalemu. Ndi vamtumili Banaba ahamba ku Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Peahikili kwenuko avawene vandu vamotisiwi na Chapanga, ndi akavya na luheku na kuvakangamalisa mitima voha vasindimala musadika yavi kwa Bambu. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Banaba avili mundu mbwina na mweamemiswi Mpungu Msopi na sadika, ndava ya lihengu la Banaba msambi uvaha wa vandu wayonjokisiki kwa Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Kangi, Banaba akawuka na kuhamba ku Taso kumlonda Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Hati peamuwene, amletili ku Antiokia. Voha vavili vakatama pamonga na msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu mu mwaka mmonga, kuni viwula msambi uvaha wa vandu. Ku Antiokia kwenuko ndi vawuliwa va kutumbula vakemeliwi Vakilisitu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Mu magono genago, vamlota vangi va Chapanga vahumili ku Yelusalemu vakahelela ku Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Hinu, mmonga wavi mweikemiwa Agabo alotili yati kwiva na njala yivaha pamulima wula. Njala yeniyo yahumalili lukumbi lwa ulongosi wa Kilaudio. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Vawuliwa vala vakahamula kuvatangatila vamsadika vevatama ku Yudea, kila mmonga apeleka chindu chochoha cheihotola. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ndi vakakita mewa na kuvapela njombi zavi Banaba na Sauli vakavagotolela vagogo va vamsadika.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Mang'ahiso gamahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Papipi na Lukumbi lwenulo, Nkosi Helodi atumbwili kuvang'aha msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Ahamwili Yakobo akomiwa na upanga, mlongo wa Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Peamanyili kuvya lijambu lenilo lavaganisi Vayawudi, ndi ayendalili akamkamula Petili. Lenilo lahengiki lukumbi lwa Mselebuko wa Mabumunda gangali ngemeku. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Peamali kumkamula Petili, akamsopa muchifungu, akavika manjolinjoli mcheche mu msambi mcheche. Helodi aganili kumuhumisa pavandu pawimalika Mselebuko wa Pasaka. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Hinu, lukumbi Petili avi muchifungu, nambu msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vayendalili kumuyupa Chapanga kwa kukangamala.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili isanguliwa kuhuma muchifungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Kilu kwakona ligono Helodi lealindila kumuhumisa Petili pavandu, Petili agonili pagati ya manjolinjoli vavili. Kuni akungiwi minyololo yivili, na valonda vavi mlyangu wa kujela mukulindila. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Bahapo, mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamuhumila na kuyima papipi nayu na lumuli wamlangisi muchifungu. Mtumu wa Kunani kwa Chapanga yula akamtova Petili muluvafu akamuyumsa akamjovela, “Yumuka kanyata!” Bahapo, minyololo yevamkungalili mu mawoko yikadaukana na kugwa pahi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Hinu mtumu wa Kunani kwa Chapanga akamjovela, “Kunga mkungi na champali zaku.” Kangi akamjovela, “Uwala likoti laku na unilandayi.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petili akamlanda mbaka kuvala, nambu nakumanya kuvya gegihengeka na mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga gala ndi gachakaka, aholalili manya ilota maono. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Vapitili msambi wa valonda va kutumbula na kugelekela chingi, ndi vakahika pamlyangu wa lyuma wa kuyingila pamuji. Mlyangu wula wadindwiki wene, navene vakahuma kuvala. Pavagendayi munjila bahapo mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga yula akamleka Petili.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Hinu Petili peamanyili gegahumili, akajova, “Hinu nimanya chakaka kuvya Bambu amtumili mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga anisangula kuhuma mu mawoko ga Helodi na mambu goha Vayawudi gevalindalila.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Peamanyili genago, ndi akahamba mbaka kunyumba ya Maliya nyina waki Yohani mweikemiwa mewawa Maluko. Mwenumo vandu vamahele vakonganiki kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petili ahodisi mlyangu wa kuvala na mdala mmonga mtumisi liina laki Loda, akamyidakila. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Msikana yula amanyili kuvya mweihodisa ndi Petili, akavya na luheku neju, hati kwakona kudindula mlyangu wula ndi akajumbalila mugati kuvajovela kuvya Petili ayimili kuvala ya mlyangu. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Vakamjovela msikana yula, “Una lupengu!” Nambu mwene akakangamala kujova chakaka. Vene vakamyangula, “Mwenuyo ndi manya mtumi waki.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Lukumbi lwenulo Petili ayendelela kuhodisa mlyangu. Pamwishu vakadindula mlyangu pavamuwene vakakangasa neju. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Mwene akavagunisa kwa kuvalangisa chiwoko, akavadandaulila Bambu cheamusiwi muchifungu. Kangi akavajovela lijambu lenilo vavajovela Yakobo na vamsadika vangi vala, kavili akawuka na kuhamba pandu pangi.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Kwapachili wogohi wavayingili manjolinjoli vala, vakatumbula kukotana, “Kyani chechimkolili Petili?” <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helodi akalagazila vamlonda, nambu vamuwene lepi. Hinu akalagiza manjolinjoli vala vakotiwa, kangi akahamula vakomiwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Helodi akawuka ku Yudea kula, na kuhamba kumuji wa Kaisalia na kutama.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Helodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Helodi ayomiswi neju na vandu va ku Tilo na vandu va ku Sidoni, hinu vene vampelekili vajumbi. Vene vakahotola kumkulukisa hoti Blasto avyaa upandi wavi, Blasto avi myimilila mkulu wa nyumba ya Unkosi. Kangi vakamhambila Helodi na kumuyupa kuvya na uteke, muni mulima wavi wahuvalila mulima wa Nkosi ndava ya chakulya.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Ligono limonga lelahaguliwi, Helodi kuni awalili nyula yaki ya unkosi na kutama pachigoda cha unkosi, avakokosili vandu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Vandu vala vakaluluta kwa lwami vakajova, “Lwenulo ndi lwami lwa chapanga, lepi lwa mundu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Bahapo mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamgwisa Helodi pahi ndava amlumbalili lepi Chapanga, ndi akamemenwa na mangokoko ndi afwili.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Nambu Linenu la Chapanga likayonjokesa kukula na kudandasika.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Banaba na Sauli pevamalili lihengu lavi, vakawuya ku Yelusalemu vakamtola Yohani mweikemiwa Maluko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Banaba na Sauli vihaguliwa na kutumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mu msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Antiokia kwavili na vandu vangi vevavi vamlota va Chapanga na vawula, pagati yavi vavi Banaba na Sauli na Simioni mweikemiwa mtitu, Lukio wa Kulene, Manaeni mwealeliwi pamonga na Nkosi Helodi. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Pavamuyupayi Bambu na kujihinisa chakulya, Mpungu Msopi akavajovela, “Mnihagulila Banaba na Sauli ndava ya lihengu lenivakemelili.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Hinu vakajihinisa chakulya neju na kumuyupa Chapanga, vakavapamisa mawoko panani yavi vakavatuma vahamba.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banaba na Sauli vikokosa ku Kuplo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Hinu, Mpungu Msopi peamali kuvatuma Banaba na Sauli, vakahelela mbaka Seleukia na kuhuma kwenuko vakayingila muwatu mbaka kukisiwa cha Kuplo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Pavahikili ku Salami vakakokosa Linenu la Chapanga munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi. Yohani Maluko avi mtangatila wavi.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Vagendili kuhuma upandi umonga na kuhamba upandi wungi wa kisiwa na kuhika Pafo, vamkolili mundu mmonga Myawudi mhavi liina laki Bal yesu mlota wa udesi. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Mwenuyo avi pamonga na Seligio Pauli, mkulu wa kisiwa chila avi mundu wa luhala neju. Selgio Pauli avakemili Banaba na Sauli muni ayuwana Linenu la Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Nambu mhavi yula Bal yesu mweikemelewa Elima kwa Chigiliki, alingili kuvabelelela muni kumbesa mkulu wa kisiwa chila akotoka kusadika sadika ya Chikilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Hinu Sauli mweikemiwa mewa Pauli, kuni amemisiwi Mpungu Msopi, akamlolokesa takataka mhavi yula, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />na kujova, “Veve wamwana wa Setani, likoko wa kila chindu chechimganisa Chapanga, mweumemili uhakau na udesi. Nakuleka hati padebe kubudisa uchakaka wa njila selede za Bambu! <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Hinu, chiwoko cha Bambu yati chikubuna, yati wivya ngalola nakuhotola kulola lilanga mulukumbi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Bahapo Elima chitita chikayingila mumihu gaki hati gakakoyoko, hati akatumbula kupamisa kuni na kuni, kulonda mundu wa kumkamula chiwoko amulongosa. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Mkulu wa kisiwa yula peagawene mambu gala, akasadika, akakangasa neju ndava ya mawuliwu gakumvala Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banaba na Pauli kumuji wa Antiokia pamulima wa Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Kangi Pauli na vayaki vakawuka Pafo, vakayingila muwatu na kuhamba kumuji wa Peliga mulima wa Pamfulia. Nambu Yohani Maluko avalekili na kuwuya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Nambu vene vayendalili na lugendu kuhuma Peliga mbaka pamuji wa Antiokia ya Pisidia. Ligono la Kupumulila vakayingila munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi na kutama pahi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Pevamali kusoma muchitabu cha malagizu ga Bambu geampeli Musa na Mayandiku ga Vamlota va Chapanga, vala vachilongosi va nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi yila vavatumili ujumbi uwu, “Valongo ngati kuvi na malovi ga kuvakangamalisa mitima vandu ava mujova.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Ndi Pauli akayima na kuvapungila chiwoko na kutumbula kuvajovela, “Vakolonjinji va Isilaeli na voha mwemumtopesa Chapanga, muniyuwanila! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Chapanga wa mulima uwu wa Isilaeli avahagwili vagogo vitu, akavakita vandu va kuvya mulima uvaha pavatamayi kuuyehe ku Misili. Kangi akavawusa kwenuko kwa makakala gaki. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Akasindimala nawu mulukumbi lwa miyaka alobaini kulugangatu kula. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Akagakomekesa makabila saba ga mulima wa Kanani ndi akavapela mulima wenuwo vandu avo kuvya uhali wavi. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Mambu ago gahengiki kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka miya mcheche na hamsini.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Kangi akavapela vahamula mihalu vavalongosa mbaka magono ga mlota wa Chapanga Samweli. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Chechagelekili ndi vakamyupa nkosi, ndi Chapanga akavapela Sauli mwana wa Kishi wa lukolo lwa Benjamini, akalongosa mulukumbi lwa miyaka alobaini. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Peamuwusili Sauli, Chapanga akamhagula Daudi avya nkosi wavi. Chapanga mwene akavajovela hotohoto, nimhagwili Daudi mwana wa Yese, ndava muni mundu mweakuniganisa. Mwenuyo ndi mweihenga mambu goha genikugagana. <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kuhuma mu chiveleku cha mundu mwenuyo, Chapanga ngati cheavalagizi vandu va Isilaeli kuvapelekela Msangula ndi Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Yesu peavi akona kutumbula lihengu laki, Yohani amlongolili na kuvakokosela vandu voha va Isilaeli kuvya yikuvagana vamuwuyila Chapanga na kubatiziwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yohani peavi mukumala ujumbi waki avajovili vandu, Mwiholela nene ndi yani? Mwemkumlindila lepi nene. Nambu yuwanila! Mweibwela mumbela yangu, nene nakuganikiwa hati kuwopola nyosi za champali zaki!”<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Valongo vangu, nyenye chiveleku cha Ibulahimu, na vangi voha mwemkumtopesa Chapanga! Ujumbi uwu wa usangula uletiwi kwitu! <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Muni vakolonjinji va Yelusalemu na vakulu vavi vammanyili lepi Yesu kuvya Msangula, katu nakugamanya malovi ga vamlota va Chapanga gegasomewa kila Ligono la Kupumulila. Pamonga na ago vakagatimilisi kwa kumkoma Yesu lifwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Pamonga na avi lepi na yeyikumgana akomiwa, vamyupili Pilatu amhukumwa lifwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Na pevamali kuhenga goha gegayandikiwi kumvala Yesu, vakamuhulusa kuhuma mu msalaba, vakamvika mu litinda la mbugu. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Nambu Chapanga amuyukisi kwevafwili. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Mwene kwa magono gamahele, avahumalili vealongosini nawu kuhuma ku Galilaya mbaka ku Yelusalemu. Venavo ndi hinu vandu vevakujovela vandu va Isilaeli mambu ga Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Hinu tete tikuvakokosela nyenye Linenu la Bwina, lenilo ndi lilaganu kwa vagogo vitu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Chapanga ahengili lilaganu lenilo ndava yitu tete chiveleku chavi kwa kumyukisa Yesu, ngati cheyiyandikiwi Muzabuli ya pili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Veve ndi Wamwana vangu na nene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">lelu na Dadi waku.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Na ndava ya kumyukisa kwevafwili, nakuwuya kavili kwenuko ndi awolili lepi. Chapanga ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Yati nikupela mota ya usopi na uchakaka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">zezanamlagazili Daudi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Hinu wijova mu mayandiku gangi ga Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Umleka lepi Msopi waku awola.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Daudi mwene ahengili geigana Chapanga mulukumbi lwaki, na kangi afwili na kuvikiwa mu litinda la mbugu papipi na vagogo vaki, na higa yaki yawolili. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Nambu yula mweayukiswi na Chapanga kwa vafwili awolili lepi. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Ndava muni valongo vitu tigana nyenye mumanya chakaka kuvya munjila ya Yesu, ujumbi wa kulekekesewa kumbudila Chapanga ukokoswa kwinu, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />mundu yoyoha mweamsadika mwene ndi ilekekesewa kumbudila Chapanga kwoha, lijambu langahotoleka ndava ya kulanda Malagizu ga Bambu geampeli Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Mujiyangalila, gegajoviwi na vamlota va Chapanga gala gakotoka kuvakolela,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Myuwanila, nyenye mwemuvi na likomo, mkangasayi na mfwayi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Muni chindu chenihenga hinu, mulusenje lwinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">yati musadika lepi hati ngati mundu avajovoli.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Pauli na Banaba pavawukili munyumba ya kuyupila Chapanga mula, vandu vala vakavagongolela vabwela Ligono la Kupumulila leligelekela, vavakangamalisa mambu gala. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Mngonganu wula pawamaliki Vayawudi vamahele na vandu vangali Vayawudi vevayingili njila ya kumuyupa Chapanga ya Vayawudi ndi vakavalanda Pauli na Banaba. Vene vakalongela nawu na kuvakangamalisa mitima vayendelela kutama kwa kuhuvalila ubwina wa Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Ligono la Kupumulila lila lelagelekili kila mundu pamuji wula abwelili kuyuwanila Linenu la Bambu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Nambu Vayawudi pavawaweni vandu vamahele vakamema wihu, vakagabela malovi gaajovayi Pauli na vakamliga. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Pauli na Banaba vakalongela kwa ukekesi neju, “Yaganikiwi Linenu la Chapanga litumbula kuvahikila hoti nyenye, nambu ndava mulibelili na kuvya nakuhotola kupokela wumi wa magono goha, hinu tikuvaleka na kuvahambila vandu vangali Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Muni Bambu atilagazili aga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Nikuviki lumuli lwa vandu va pamulima, muni vandu voha vasanguliwa pamilima yoha.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Vandu vangali Vayawudi pevayuwini lijambu lila vakavya na luheku, vakaulumbalila ujumbi wa Bambu na vevahaguliwi vala kupewa na wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu, vakavya vamsadika.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Linenu la Bambu ladandasiki kila pandu pamulima. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Nambu Vayawudi vakavakulukisa vadala vangali Vayawudi vevitopeswa vevakumuyupa Chapanga na vagosi vevimanyikana wa muji wula. Vakatumbula kuvang'aha Pauli na Banaba, vakavavinga vahuma pamuji wavi. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Hinu vamitumi vala vakakung'unda lububu mumagendelu gavi kulangisa vabeli Linenu la Bambu na vakahamba ku Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Na vamsadika va ku Antiokia, ndi vamemiswi luheku na Mpungu Msopi.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Pauli na Banaba ku Ikonio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Mewawa ku Ikonio kula, Pauli na Banaba vakayingila munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi. Vakalongela cha ukekesi hati msambi uvaha wa Vayawudi na Vagiliki vakasadika. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Nambu Vayawudi vevabeli kusadika vakavakulukisa vandu vangali Vayawudi vavayomela Pauli na Banaba. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Vayendalili kutama kwenuko mulukumbi lutali. Vakalongela cha ukekesi ndava ya Bambu, na Bambu mwene ajilangisi uchakaka wa ujumbi wevihumisa kwa ubwina waki, kwa kuvahotosa kukita gachinamtiti na makangaso. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Vandu va muji wula vakalekengana, vangi vakavya upandi wa Vayawudi na vangi vakavya upandi wa vamitumi vala.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Kangi vandu vangali Vayawudi na Vayawudi pamonga na vachilongosi wavi, vakakita mpangu wa kuvakitila gahakau na kuvakoma kwa maganga. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Vamitumi vala pevamanyili mpangu wenuwo, vakajumbalila ku Lusitila na ku Delibe, miji ya ku Lukonia, na pamwambu ya miji ya papipi, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />ndi vakayendelela kukokosa Linenu la Bwina.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Banaba ku Lisitila na ku Delibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Lusitila kwenuko kwavili na mundu mmonga mweavi ngagenda kutumbula kuvelekewa kwaki, katu nakuhotola kugenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Ngagenda yula amyuwanilayi Pauli peakokosayi. Hinu Pauli akamlolokesa takataka na peamanyili kuvya avi na sadika ya kuhotola kulamiswa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />akamjovela kwa lwami luvaha, “Yima na magendelu gaku!” Bahapo mundu yula akahumba na kutumbula kugenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Msambi wa vandu pavawene lijambu leakitili Pauli, vakajova kwa lwami luvaha muluga ya Kilukaonia, “Hinu vachapanga vatibwelili kwa musula ya mundu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Vakavapele mahina ga uchapanga, Banaba vakamkemela Zeu, na Pauli ndava muni avi mjovaji mkulu, vakamkemela Helime. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Mteta wa chapanga Zeu, nyumba yaki yavi pamuhana ya muji, akagega ng'ombi mpapakasi na njingwa ya maluva palongolo ya mlyangu ukulu muji pamonga na msambi wa vandu vagana kuvawusila luteta vamitumi.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Nambu Banaba na Pauli pevayuwini malovi gala vakapapula nyula zavi na kujumbalila pamsambi wa vandu wula, na kujova kwa lwami luvaha. <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Vagosi nyenye, ndava kyani mwikita lijambu lenili? Tete mewa tavandu ngati nyenye. Ndi tikuvakokosela Linenu la Bwina, nyenye mukoto kugundamila chimong'omong'o, mumuwuyila Chapanga wa wumi, mweawumbili kunani na mulima na nyanja pamonga na vindu vyoha. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Kadeni Chapanga avalekekisi vandu voha vahenga chevigana vene. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Nambu Chapanga alekili lepi kujilangisa kwa mambu gabwina geavahengili, kuvatonyela fula kuhuma kunani, kuvapela mabenu mulukumbi lwaki na kuvapela chakulya cha kuyimemesa mitima yavi luheku.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Pamonga na vamitumi kujova malovi genago, yavili nakunonopa kuubelelela msambi wa vandu ukoto kuvawusila luteta.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Kangi Vayawudi nunuyu vakabwela kuhuma Antiokia na Ikonio, vakavakulukisa vandu, vamtova Pauli na maganga. Vakamkwega mbaka kuvala ya muji, kuni vahololela afwili. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Nambu vawuliwa pavamtindili akayumuka akawuya kumujini. Chilau yaki mwene pamonga na Banaba vakahamba ku Delibe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Banaba viwuya kumuji wa ku Antiokia ya ku Silia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pauli na Banaba vakakokosa Linenu la Bwina ku Delibe, ndi vakayonjokeseka vawuliwa vamahele. Kangi vakawuya ku Antiokia vakavedukila Lusitila na Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Ndi vakavakangamalisa mitima vamsadika, vasindimala na sadika yavi, vakavajovela ngati tavoha yikutigana kuyingila Muunkosi wa Chapanga munjila ya mang'ahiso gavaha. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Pauli na Banaba vakavahagula vagogo mukila msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ndava ya kuyupa Chapanga na kujihinisa chakulya, vakavavika muulonda wa Bambu mwevakumsadika.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Pevamalili kupitila Pisidia ndi vakahika Pamfulia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Kangi pevamalili kuvakokosela ujumbi wula vandu va ku Peliga, ndi vakahamba ku Atalia. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Mulugendu vakahuma ku Atalia vakawuya ku Antiokia kwevayupiwi ubwina wa Chapanga, ndava ya lihengu levakitili.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Na pavahikili vahengili mngonganu na vamsadika vakavajovela vandu mambu goha, Chapanga geagahengili pamonga nawu, na cheavadindulili vandu vangali Vayawudi mlyangu wa sadika. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Ndi vakatama pamonga mulukumbi lutali na vamsadika vala.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mngonganu ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Hinu, vandu vangi vakahuma ku Yudea na kubwela ku Antiokia, vakatumbula kuvawula valongo vala, nakuhotola kusanguliwa ngati mwangayingila jandu, ngati mvelu wa Musa cheulagiza. <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Pauli na Banaba vakavya na mhutanu na vandu vala ndava ya lijambu lila, ndi vakahamuliwa Pauli na Banaba pamonga na vamsadika vangi va Antiokia vahamba ku Yelusalemu kukonganeka na vagogo na vamitumi ndava ya lijambu lenilo.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Mulugendu lwavi msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ndi vavatangatili, vakapitila ku Foinike na ku Samaliya na kuvajovela vandu vangali Vayawudi chavamsadiki Chapanga. Malovi ago gavagahekisi neju vamsadika voha. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Pavahikili ku Yelusalemu, vakagongolelewa na msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu na vamitumi na vagogo, vene vakavajovela mambu goha Chapanga geagahengili pamonga nawu. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Nambu vamsadika vangi va msambi wa Vafalisayu vakayima na kujova, “Yikuvagana vandu vangali Vayawudi vadumuliwa jandu na kuvalagiza kulanda mhilu wa Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Hinu vamitumi na vagogo vakakonganeka ndava ya kulongalela lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Ndi pavakotini neju, Petili akayima na kujova, “Valongo vangu, mumanyili kuvya Chapanga anihagwili nene kadeni pagati yinu muni nikokosayi Linenu la Bwina kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi navene vayuwana na vasadikayi. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Na Chapanga mweimanya mitima ya vandu, ajilangisi kuvayidakila kuvapela Mpungu Msopi vene ngati cheatipeli tete. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Nakuvabagula vandu, tete amala vene, ainyambisi mitima yavi ndava vakumsadika. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Hinu ndava kyani kumlinga Chapanga, mukuvagegesa ndwika vamsadika vala, ndwika vagogo vitu wala tavete tihotola lepi kugega? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Lepi, ndi tete tisadika ngati vene, yati tisanguliwa munjila ya ubwina wa Bambu Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Mngonganu wa vandu voha wagunili nuu, ukuwayuwanila Pauli na Banaba vidandaula gachinamtiti na makangaso, Chapanga geagahengili muujumbi wavi kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Pevamali kulongela, Yakobo akatumbula kujova, “Muniyuwanila valongo vangu! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni Petili atidandaulili Chapanga penapo kadeni cheajilangisi kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi na kuvahagula vangi pagati yavi, vavyai vandu vaki. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Lijambu lenilo ndi liyidakilana na malovi ga vamlota va Chapanga, ngati Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Bambu ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">pagenaga yati niwuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na kuujenga kavili nyumba ya Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">yeyigwili.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Vandu vangi voha na vandu vangali Vayawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">voha venivakemili vavyayi vangu yati vakunilonda Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ndi cheajovili Bambu, mweagamanyisi mambu aga kuhuma kadeni.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakobo akayendelela kujova, “Nene nilola kuvya chabwina lepi kuvang'aha vandu vangali Vayawudi vevakumsadika Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Nambu chabwina tivayandikila ujumbi kuvajovela, vayepa kulya vyakula vihakasa vya mahoka, vayepa ukemi vayepa kulya hinyama yidodanu na vayepa kulya ngasi. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Ndava muni kutumbula kadeni mhilu wa Chapanga weampelili Musa, wisomiwa kila Ligono la Kupumulila munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi, na malovi gaki gikokoselewa kila muji.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi kwa vamsadika vangali Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Kangi vamitumi na vagogo va msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu voha vakahamula kuvahagula vandu nunuyu mumasambi wavi na kuvatuma ku Antiokia pamonga na Pauli na Banaba. Ndi vakamhagula Yuda mweikemiwa Basaba na Sila, vevitopeswa neju na vamsadika. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Vavapelili ujumbi weuyandikiwi aga, “Tete vamitumi na vagogo, valongo vinu, tikuvajambusa vayitu mwangali kuvya Vayawudi mwemuvi ku Antiokia na ku Silia na ku Kilikia. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tiyuwini kuvya vandu nunuyo vakuhuma kwitu vavang'aisi mtima yinu na malovi gavi, vahengili genago changali malagizu gitu. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Hinu kwa pamonga tiyidakilini kuvahagula vajumbi vangi, valongosana pamonga na vankozi vitu Pauli na Banaba tivatumili kubwela kwinu. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Vandu vevajiwusili kuyagisa wumi wavi ndava ya kumhengela Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ndava muni tivatumili Yuda na muyaki Sila, vene yati vakuvadandaulila malovi goha getivayandikili. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Hinu yimganisi Mpungu Msopi na tete tikotoka kuvagegesa ndwika neju ya mambu gala gegalagaziwi. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Mkoto kulya vyakulya veviwusiwi mahoka, kavili ngasi ya hinyama mkoto kunywa na mewawa hinyama yevadodili mkoto kulya, myepa ukemi. Yati muhenga chabwina ngati muyepili kuhenga mambu ago!”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ndi pevamali kulagana, vajumbi vala vakawuka na kuhamba ku Antiokia. Kwenuko vakaukemela msambi wa vamsadika na kuvagotolela balua yeyiyandikwi yila. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Hinu pevamali kusoma ujumbi wula, malovi gaki gakavangamalisa mitima, vakavya na luheku neju. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda na Sila vevavi vamlota va Chapanga, valongili nawu mulukumbi lutali vakuvapolesa na kuvakangamalisa mitima. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Pevamali kutama kwa lukumbi, valongo va ku Antiokia vakalagana nawu, vakavaganila uteke, kangi vakawuya kuhamba kula kwevatumwili. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Nambu sila ahamwili kusigalila.<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Nambu Pauli na Banaba vasigalili ku Antiokia, kwenuko vene pamonga na vandu vangi vamahele vawulili na kuvakokosela Linenu la Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Banaba vilekengana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Magono nunuyu gegagelekili Pauli akamjovela Banaba, “Tiwuya tikavagendela valongo vala vetavakokosili linenu la Bambu tikaloli cheviyendelela.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Banaba aganili mewa vamtola Yohani mweikemiwa Maluko. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Nambu Pauli aganili lepi kumtola Maluko, ndava mumbele avalekili ku Pamfulia na kubela kuvya pamonga mulihengu lavi. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Ndi ukahumila muhutanu uvaha pagati yavi, hati vakalekengana. Banaba akamtola Maluko, vakayingila muwatu na kuhamba ku Kuplo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Pauli mwene akamhagula Sila, hinu vamsadika pevamali kuvayupila ubwina wa Bambu vakawuka. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Mulugendu lula vakapitila ku Silia na Kukilikia kuvakangamalisa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti itumbula lugendu pamonga na Pauli na Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Hinu akahika ku Delibe na ku Lusitila, kweatamayi muwuliwa mmonga liina laki Timoti. Nyina waki mewawa avi msadika Myawudi, nambu dadi waki avi Mgiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timoti alumbiwi bwina na vamsadika va ku Lusitila na ku Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pauli aganili kulongosana na Timoti mulugendu, hinu akamdumula jandu. Akitili chenicho ndava Vayawudi voha vevatamayi pandi zila, vamanyili kuvya dadi wa Timoti avi Mgiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Pavavi mulugendu lwa mumiji vavajovela vandu malagizu ga vamitumi vala na vagogo vala va ku Yelusalemu, vakavajovela vagalanda. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Hinu msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika kilisitu vakangamala muusadika, ndi vakayonjokeseka kila ligono.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ilota maono ku Tloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Vakapitila mumiji ya Flugia na Galatia muni Mpungu Msopi nakuvayidakila kukokosa ujumbi wula ku Asia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Pavahikili mumibaka ya Musia, valingili kuyingila mulima wa Bisunia. Nambu Mpungu wa Yesu nakuvayidakila. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Hinu vapitili ku Musia na kuhamba lumonga ku Tloa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Lukumbi lwa kilu, Pauli akalota maono amuwene mundu mmonga wa ku Makedonia ayimili balapala na kumuyupa, “Kupuka ubwela ku Makedonia utitangatila.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Pauli peagawene maono gala, bahapo tajitendelekili kukupuka kuhamba Makedonia muni tamanyili chakaka Chapanga atikemili tihamba kuvakokosela Linenu la Bwina kwenuko.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidia akumsadika Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Tagendili muwatu kuhuma ku Tloa mbaka Samotilake, na chilau yaki tahikili Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kuhuma kwenuko tikahamba ku Filipi muji mmonga pamulima wa Makedonia, Likoloni la Valumi. Ndi tatamili muji wenuwo mulukumbi lwa magono. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Ligono la Kupumulila tahumuli kuvala ya muji, na kuhamba pamuhana ya mfuleni pandu petahololela pakuyupila Chapanga. Ndi tikatama na kulongela na vadala vevakonganiki penapo. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Mmonga wa vadala vevatiyuwanila vala, avi mdala mmonga msadika liina laki Lidia, mkolonjinji wa Tuatila, mweigula na kugulisa nyula za mashonga gamahele. Bambu amdindwili mtima waki hati akagalanda malovi gala geajova Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Mdala yula pamonga na vandu va munyumba yaki pevamali kubatiziwa, akatigongolela, “Ngati chakaka myidakili kuvya nene namsadika wa Bambu, mbwela kutama kunyumba yangu.” Akakangamala kutijovela tihamba.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Sila vikamuliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ligono limonga patakavi mukuhamba pandu pa kumuyupa Chapanga, takonganiki na msikana mmonga mvanda mweavi na mzuka wa kulondola. Mdala mwenuyo avapela mashonga gamahele vandu vana vindu vyamahele ndava ulondola waki. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Msikana yula akatilanda Pauli na tete, ijova kwa lwami luvaha, “Vandu ava ndi vatumisi va Chapanga Mkulu! Vakuvadandaulila njila ya kusanguka!” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Akitili chenicho kwa magono gamahele mbaka ligono limonga Pauli akayoma, akamng'anamukila na kuujovela mzuka wula, “Muuhotola wa Yesu Kilisitu nikulagiza muwuka mundu uyu!” Bahapo mzuka wula ukamuwuka.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Vakulu va mvanda yula pavawene mpangu wavi wa kupata mashonga kuhuma kwa mvanda wavi umaliki, vakavakamula Pauli na Sila na kuvakwekesa pandu pakugulisila vindu, palongolo ya vakulu va muji. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Vakavatakila kwa vahamula mihalu va Loma na kujova, “Vandu ava vileta chitututu pamuji witu navene ndi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Viwula mivelu yeyibesiwi kwa tete vandu va ku Loma kuyidakila na kuyilanda.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Na msambi wa vandu wewavi penapo ukavatova Pauli na Sila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Kangi vahamula mihalu vala vakavapapula nyula za Pauli na Sila, vakahamula vatovewayi ndonga. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Pevamali kuvatova neju, vakavasopa muchifungu na linjolinjoli wa jela alagaziwi kuvya mihu muulonda. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Ndava ya malagizu genago, linjolinjoli wa jela akavasopa muchumba cha mugati neju na kuvakunga magendelu gavi muhibiki.<figure style="fig" file="21 Feet in Stocks.jpg" size="col" ref="16:24">Vandu vavili vakungiwi magendelu muchibiki</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Peyahikili pagati ya kilu Pauli na Sila vamuyupayi na kumuyimbila nyimbu za kumulumbalila Chapanga, kuni vafungwa vayavi vakuvayuwanila. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Chigafula mndendemo mvaha wa ndima ukahumila, wewanyugwisi mikingisa ya jela. Bahapo milyangu hikadinduka na minyololo yevakungiwi vafungwa yikawopoka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Linjolinjoli wa jela peayumwiki na kulola milyangu ya jela gavi mbee, akatola upanga na kugana kujikoma, ndava aholalili kuvya vafungwa voha vatilili. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Nambu Pauli akakemela kwa lwami luvaha, “Ukoto kujikoma wamwene, muni tee tavoha takona tivii!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Linjolinjoli yula peamali kuyupa hahi, akajumbalila mugati akajigwisa pahi pa magendelu ga Pauli na Sila kuni ivagaya kwa wogohi. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Kangi akavalongosa mbaka kuvala, akavakota, “Mwavakulu vangu, nikita kyani nihotola kusanguka?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Vene vakamyangula, “Umsadika Bambu Yesu ndi veve pamonga na vandu va munyumba yaku yati mwisanguliwa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Hinu vakamkokosela Linenu la Bambu mwene pamonga na vandu va munyumba yaki. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Lukumbi lulolo lwa kilu, linjolinjoli wa jela yula akavatola na kuvasambisa mavamba gavi, kangi mwene na vandu va munyumba yaki vabatiziwi bahapo. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Kangi akavagongolela Pauli na Sila kunyumba yaki, kuvapela chakulya. Mwene pamonga na vandu va munyumba yaki vakavya na luheku neju ndava hinu vakumsadika Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Chilau yaki lukela, vahamula mihalu va Chiloma vavatumili vakulu va manjolinjoli na malagizu aga, “Muvadindulila vandu vala.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Linjolinjoli wa jela akamjovela Pauli, “Vahamula mihalu va Loma vatumili na ujumbi uwu kwa veve na Sila mudinduliwayi. Hinu mwihotola kuhuma na muhamba na uteke.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Nambu Pauli akamyangula, “Gavi wuli? Tahokili lepi vatitovili ndonga pavandu kuni tavete tavakolonjinji wa ku Loma. Kangi vatisopili muchifungu na hinu vigana kutidindulila cha mfiyu! Hati padebe! Yikuvagana vene vahamula mihalu ndi vabwela kutidindulila.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Vakulu va manjolinjoli vakavadandaulila lijambu lila vahamula mihalu, hinu vene pevayuwini kuvya Pauli na Sila vavi vakolonjinji va mulima wa ku Loma vayogwipi. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ndi vakahamba na kujova, “Chondi mpepayi,” Na pavavahumisi mugati, vakavayupa vawuka pamuji wula. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Pauli na Sila pavahumili muchifungu vakahamba kunyumba ya Lidia, kwenuko vakakonganeka na vamsadika. Pevamali kuvakangamalisa mitima vakawuka.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Chitututu ku Tesolonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Mulugendu lwavi vakapitila Amfipoli na Apolonia, vakahika ku Tesalonike kwavili na nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Na ngati chayavili mvelu wa Pauli, akayingila mugati mula na kukotana nawu kugavala mu Mayandiku Gamsopi Magono gadatu ga Kupumulila gegagekilini. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Avadandaulili na kuvalangisa kuvya yikumgana Kilisitu kung'aiswa na kuyuka. Akavajovela, “Yesu mwenikuvakokosela nyenye ndi Kilisitu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Vangi pagati yavi vakasadika na kuvya pamonga na Pauli na Sila. Mewawa Vagiliki vamahele vevakumsadika Chapanga pamonga na vadala vevitopeswa vakavya pamonga.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Nambu Vayawudi vakavya na wihu, hati vakavakoka valauni va pabomani na kukita msambi na kuhenga chitututu muji woha. Vakaizangila nyumba ya Yasoni vahuvalilayi vihotola kuvapata Pauli na Sila muni vavaleta pavandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ndava vavapatili lepi, ndi vakamukwega Yasoni na vamsadika vangi mbaka pavakulu va muji, vakajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Vandu ava ndi vevikita chitututu pamulima woha na hinu vahikili kwitu. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Yasoni avagongolili kunyumba yaki. Voha vihenga chimumbele na malagizu ga nkosi wa ku Loma, vijova kuvya avi nkosi yungi liina laki Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Ndava ya malovi ago vakavamesa ligoga vandu vamahele na vachilongosi va muji. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Hinu pevamali kumlipisa mashonga Yasoni na vayaki kangi vakavaleka vahamba.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Sila ku Belea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Kanyata kilu yila, vamsadika vala vakavatuma Pauli na Sila vahamba ku Belea. Navene pavahikili kwenuko vakayingila munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Vayawudi va ku Belea vavi vayuwanaji neju kuliku Vayawudi va ku Tesalonike, valipokili Linenu la Chapanga na kugalingulila bwina Mayandiku Gamsopi muni vamanya ngati Pauli na Sila ijova malovi ga chakaka. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Vandu vamahele pagati yavi vasadiki, vavi na vadala va Chigiliki vevitopeswa mewa na vagosi. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Nambu Vayawudi wa ku Tesalonike pevamanyili kuvya Pauli akokosayi Linenu la Chapanga Belea, vakahamba kwenuko na kutumbula chitututu na kuvakokeha vandu vamahele. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Vamsadika vala vakamhindikila kanyata Pauli ahamba kumbwani, nambu Sila na Timoti vasigalili balapala. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Vandu vala vakamhindikila Pauli mbaka Atene. Kangi vakawuya na kuni valagaziwi na Pauli kuvya, Sila na Timoti vamlanda kanyata.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kumuji wa Atene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Pauli peavalindilayi Sila na Timoti ku Atene kula, akaviniswa neju mumtima waki ndava auwene muji wula umemili vimong'omong'o vya uchapanga. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ajovisini na Vayawudi na vandu vangi vevakumsadika Chapanga, munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi, ndi kila ligono ajovesana na vandu vevahumila pandu pakugulisila vindu. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Vandu vevalanda mawuliwu ga Epikulo na Stoiki vakotini nayu. Ndi vangi vakajova, “Igana kujova kyani muyimu uyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Hinu vangi vakajova, “Ikokosela vachapanga vachiyehe.” Ndava Pauli avakokosela malovi ga kumvala Yesu na kuyuka, <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Kangi vakamgongolela Pauli na ahamba palongolo ya libanji lelikemelewa Aleopago, vakajova, “Tigana utimanyisa mawuliwu aga gamupya geukugajova. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ndava muni ukutijovela mambu ga chiyehe mumakutu gitu. Tigana kumanya maana ya mambu ago.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Vandu va ku Atene pamonga na vayehe va kwenuko lukumbi lwavi lwoha vadandaulilana na kuyuwanila mambu gamupya.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Pauli akayima pa libanji la Aleopago, akajova, “Vandu va ku Atene! Nikuvalola nyenye kuvya vandu mwemukumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ndava panapitayi kuni na kula na kulola mambu ga kuyupa kwinu, napawene pandu pa kuwusila teta pepayandikwi, ‘Kwa Chapanga Angamanyikana.’ Hinu nene nikuvakokosela malovi gaki mwenuyo mwemukumuyupa changali kumanya. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Chapanga mweawumbili mulima pamonga vindu vyoha yvevivi mugati yaki, ndi Bambu wa kunani na pamulima, mwene nakutama Nyumba za Chapanga zezijengiwi na mawoko ga vandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Mwene igana lepi kuhengewa na vandu, ngati kuvya igana utangatila wowoha wula, ndava muni mwene ndi mweakuvapela vandu wumi, mweakuvahotosa kukeka na kuvapela kila chindu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kuhuma kwa mundu mmonga, mwene awumbili vandu va milima yoha muni vatama pamulima woha, avapangili lusenje na mibaka ya pandu pakutama. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Chapanga aganili vandu vamulanda na hati cha kupapasa, vahotola kumhikila. Nambu mwene avi lepi patali na kila mmonga witu. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ngati cheajovili mundu mmonga kuvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘mugati mwaki tete titama na kugenda na tivili!’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Ngati vayimbaji vangi chavijova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Tete ndi vana vaki.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Muni tete tavana vaki Chapanga, nakuganikiwa kumhololela mwene kuvya avi ngati zahabu amala mashonga amala liganga lelihongoliwi kwa luhala na vandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Chapanga akitili ngati ilola lepi lusenje lula vandu pavahimwiki. Nambu hinu, ihamula vandu voha kila pandu vamuwuyila mwene. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ndava amali kuhagula ligono leihamula mulima pangali kumganisila yoyoha munjila ya mundu mmonga mweamhagwili. Chapanga avalangisi voha lijambu lenilo kwa kumyukisa mundu mwenuyo kwevafwili.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Pavamuyuwini Pauli ijova lijambu la kuyuka kuhuma kwa vafwili, vangi vakamuheka nambu vangi vakajova, “Tigana kuyuwana kavili lijambu lenili.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Na Pauli akavaleka akahuma mu libanji. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Nambu vandu nunuyu vakawungana nayu, vakavya vamsadika. Pagati yavi avi Dionisi wa ku Aleopago na mdala mmonga liina laki Damali, pamonga na vandu vangi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Pauli pamuji wa Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Pagamaliki ago, Pauli akawuka ku Atene na kuhamba Kolinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Kolinto kula amkolili Myawudi mmonga liina laki Akula, mkolonjinji wa Ponto. Akula pamonga na mdala waki Plisika, vawuyili magono gagago kuhuma ku Italia ndava chilongosi Kaisali Kilaudio ahamwili Vayawudi voha vawuka ku Loma. Ndi Pauli akahamba kuvalola, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />na ndava vene vavi vevitengeneza mandanda lihengu ngati laki, ndi Pauli akatama nawu kuhenga. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kila Ligono la Kupumulila akotanayi nawu munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi alingayi kuvakulukisa Vayawudi na Vagiliki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sila na Timoti pavahikili kuhuma Makedonia, hinu lukumbi lwaki lwoha Pauli atumili ndava ya kuvakokosela Vayawudi, kuvya chakaka Yesu ndi Kilisitu Msangula. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Nambu Vayawudi pavampingayi na kutumbula kumliga, mwene akakung'unda lububu lwa munyula zaki akavajovela, “Mwakayaga kwali mwavene, nene nihokili lepi. Na kutumbula hinu nikuvahambalila vandu vangali Vayawudi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Kangi Pauli akawuka penapo na kuhamba kutama kunyumba ya mundu mmonga Mgiliki mweakumsadika Chapanga liina laki Tito Yusto nyumba yaki yavili papipi na nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipo chilongosi wa nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi yula, mwene pamonga vandu va nyumba yaki vamsadiki Bambu, Vakolinto vamahele pevayuwini ujumbi wula vakasadika na kubatiziwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Ligono limonga kilu, Bambu akamjovela Pauli mumaono, “Ukoto kuyogopa, yendelela kukokosa changali kudenyeka mtima, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Muni nene nivii pamonga na veve na kawaka mundu wa kulinga kukulemasa muni pamuji wenuwo vandu vamahele vavi upandi wangu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Hinu Pauli atamili kwenuko mulukumbi lwa mwaka umonga na upinga kuni iwula vandu Linenu la Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Nambu lukumbi Galio peavi chilongosi wa Akaya, ndi Vayawudi vakamzangila Pauli kwa pamonga na kumpeleka kulibanji la mihalu. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Vakajova “Timtakila mundu uyu ndava akuvakulukisa vandu vamuyupa Chapanga munjila yeyiyidakilana lepi na malagizu.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Pauli akona kuyangula, Galio akavajovela Vayawudi, “Myuwanila Vayawudi nyenye! Ngati kuvya chakaka lijambu lenili ngalavi la unyagaji amala uhakau nga nivayuwanili. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Nambu ngati ndava ya muhutanu wa malovi na mahina na mhilu winu, muhamula nyenye mwavene. Nene niganili lepi kuvya mhamula wa lijambu ili!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ndi akavavinga kuhuma mu libanji la mihalu. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Hinu vene vakamkamula Sostene chilongosi wa nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi, vakamtova balapala palongolo ya libanji la mihalu. Nambu Galio nakutangatila nawu hati padebe.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli iwuya ku Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Pauli akayendelela kutama na valongo va ku Kolinto kwa magono gamahele. Kangi akavalaga akayingila muwatu kuhamba ku Silia pamonga na Plisika na Akula. Kenkelea kwenuko aketili mayunju gaki ndava amali kutimilisa chilapu chaki kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Pavahikili ku Efeso ndi Pauli akavaleka Plisika na Akula, akahamba munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi, akakotana na Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Vamuyipili atama nawu palukumbi lutali, nambu nakuvayidakila. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Nambu akalagana nawu peawukayi, akavajovela, “Ngati Chapanga aganili yati nibwela kavili.” Akawuka ku Efeso muwatu.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Peahulwiki Kaisalia, Pauli akahamba pa Yelusalemu na kuvajambusa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu. Kangi akahamba ku Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Ndi akatama kwenuko mu magono gadebe akayendelela na lugendu kupitila miji ya Galatia na Flugia avakangamalisa vamsadika voha.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo ikokosa ku Efeso na ku Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Magono gagago Myawudi mmonga liina laki Apolo mkolonjinji wa Alekisanda, ndi abwelili ku Efeso. Avi na luhala lwa kulongela na mweimanya bwina Mayandiku Gamsopi. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Mundu mwenuyo awuliwi njila ya Bambu, kuni mtima waki uvi heyuheyu akatumbula kudandaula na kuwula uchakaka malovi ga Yesu, nambu mwene amanyili nga ubatizu wa Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Mwene akatumbula kulongela kwa ukekesi munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi, hinu Plisika na Akula pavamuyuwini vakamtola kuhamba nayu kunyumba yavi na kumuwula Njila ya Chapanga kwa uchakaka neju. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolo peaganili kuhamba ku Akaya, vamsadika va ku Efeso vakamkangamalisa mtima na kuvayandikila vamsadika vala vampokelayi. Peahikili kwenuko avatangatili neju vandu vevasadika vala kwa makakala ga ubwina wa Bambu. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ndi ayendalili kwa ukekesi kujovesana na kuvashinda Vayawudi pavandu ijova hotohoto mu Mayandiku Gamsopi kuvya Yesu ndi Kilisitu Msangula.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Pauli ikokosa ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Lukumbi Apolo avi Kolinto, Pauli akagenda mu vidunda na kuhika ku Efeso kwenuko avakolili vawuliwa nunuyu, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />akavakota, “Wu, mwampokili Mpungu Msopi lukumbi pamwasadiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Vene vakamyangula, “Lepi! Hati kuyuwana kuvi Mpungu Msopi.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Pauli akavakota, “Ubatizu woki wemwapatili?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Vene vakamyangula, “Ubatizu wa Yohani.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Namwene Pauli akajova, “Ubatizu wa Yohani wavi ndava ya kulangisa kuvya vandu vamali kumuwuyila Chapanga. Yohani avajovili vandu kuvya vamsadikayi yula mweibwela palongolo yaki ndi Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Hinu pevamali kugayuwanila genago, ndi vakabatiziwa muliina la Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Pauli avapamisi mawoko panani yavi na Mpungu Msopi akavahelelela, vakatumbula kulongela luga ya chiyehe na kukokosa ujumbi wa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Jumula vavi vagosi kumi na vavili.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Mulukumbi lwa miheyi yidatu Pauli ayendalili kuyingila munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi, na kukokosa cha ukekesi na kukotana nawu ndava kuvakofwa kuuvala Unkosi wa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Nambu vangi vavi na mitima yeyitopa hati vakabela kusadika, vakajova gahakau ndava ya Njila ya Bambu palongo ya msambi wa vandu. Ndi Pauli akajibagula mwene pamonga na vamsadika vala, na kila ligono akakotana nawu mu libanji la mawuliwu la mundu mmonga liina laki Tilano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Mambu ago gehengiki mulukumbi lwa miyaka yivili hati vakolonjinji voha va Asia, Vayawudi na vandu vangali Vayawudi vakayuwana Linenu la Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana va Sikewa vilinga kuhakalila mzuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Chapanga akitili gachinamititi ga kukangasa gamahele mu mawoko ya Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Hati vandu vavi mukutola hitambala ya kuhungulila na nyula zeazipamisi Pauli. Vavapelekili vatamu wavi ndi vakalama na vana mizuka mewawa, mizuka yikavahuma. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Mewawa kwavili na Vayawudi vevatyalatyala kuni na kula, kuvinga mizuka navene valinga mewa kuluwula liina la Bambu Yesu. Mewa vijova, “Nikulagiza umuhuma paliina la Yesu yula mweakumkokosa Pauli.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Vevakita genago pagati yavi vavi vasongolo saba va Sikewa, mmonga wa Vateta Vakulu wa Vayawudi.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Nambu mzuka mhakau wula ukavayangula, “Nikummanya Yesu, na kavili nikummanya Pauli, nambu mwavayani nyenye?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Na mundu mweatalaliwi na mzuka yula akavahumbila kwa chigigi voha vavili avashindili makakala. Navene vakajumba changali nyula kuni vana mavamba. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Mundu yeyoha mweitama ku Efeso, Myawudi na angali kuvya Myawudi, ayuwini lijambu lenilo. Voha vakavya na wogohi, vakalilumba liina la Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Vamsadika vamahele vakabwela na kujova hotohoto pavandu mambu gahakau gevahengili. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Vandu vamahele pagati ya vala vevikita mambu ga uhavi vakatola hitabu yavi na kuyocha motu palongo ya voha. Vakavalanga bei ya hitabu yahikili mashonga elufu hamsini. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Munjila yeniyo ndi Linenu la Bambu chalayonjokisiki kudandasika na kuvya na makakala neju.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitututu ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Chechagelekili mu mambu ago, Pauli akahamwili kuhamba ku Yelusalemu kwa kupitila Makedonia na Akaya. Akajova, “Nakahika kwenuko, mewawa yikunigana nigendelela ku Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Kangi avatumili vamtangatila vaki, Timoti na Elasito, vamlongolela kuhamba ku Makedonia, kuni mwene asigalili ku Asia magono gadebe.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Lukumbi lwenulo kweahumili chitututu neju ku Efeso ndava ya Njila yeniyo ya Bambu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Mfukuta vindu vya madini ga mashonga mmonga liina laki Demetilio, mweavi na lihengu la kutengeneza majengu gadebe gadebe gegiwanangana na nyumba ya chapanga mdala Atemi. Lihengu lila lavapelili chiyonjokesu chivaha vahengati vaki. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Demetilio avakemili pamonga na vanalihengu vangi ngati laki akavajovela, “Vagosi, mmanyili kuvya mashonga gemwipata gihumila mulihengu lenili. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Hinu mwihotola kuyuwana na kujilolela mwavene mambu geihenga Pauli, lepi Pa Efeso pene, nambu mewa ku Asia yoha. Mwene akuvakulukisa na kuvang'anamusa vandu vasadikayi kuvya vachapanga vala vevitengenezwa na vandu, hati padebe lepi vachapanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Nga lepi lihengu litu livii muhatali ya kuveveswa, nambu mewawa na nyumba ya chapanga mdala mweavimkulu, Atemi, kuvalangiwa chindu lepi. Na kuwusiwa ukulu waki, mwene mweigundamiliwa Asia na mulima woha.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Pevayuwini genago, vakamema ligoga na kutumbula kuywanga, “Mkulu ndi Atemi wa ku Efeso!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Muji woha ukamema chitututu, vakavakamula Gayo na Alistako vakolonjinji va Makedonia, vevavi mulugendu pamonga na Pauli, vakavajumbisa mbaka mu libanji la mikinu. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Pauli aganili kujilangisa mu msambi wa vandu, nambu vawuliwa vakambesa. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Hati vakulu nunuyu va muji wa Asia vevavi vankozi vaki, vampelekili ujumbi Pauli, vakamjovela akotoka kujiyagisa mukuhamba kulibanji la mikinu. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Lukumbi lwenulo kila mundu aywangayi, vangi vijova aga na vangi vijova gala, hati mngonganu wula ukapechengana. Vangi nakumanya hati ndava ya kukonganeka kwavi. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Vayawudi vakamkang'a palongolo ya vandu mundu mmonga mweikemiwa Alekisanda, ndi vakamuwusa mwene palongolo ya vandu, Alekizanda akavapungila vandu chiwoko kuvagunisa. Muni aganayi kujikengelela palongolo yavi. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Nambu pevamanyili kuvya mwene ndi Myawudi, voha kwa pamonga vakaywanga, “Mkulu ndi Atemi wa ku Efeso!” Mewawa vakayendelela kuywanga mulukumbi lwa masaa gavili.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Pamwishu myimilila lihengu wa muji akahotola kuvagunisa vandu, akavajovela, “Vakolonjinji va ku Efeso, kila mundu imanya kuvya muji witu ndi mlonda wa nyumba ya chapanga Atemi na liganga lamsopi leligwili kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Avi lepi mweihotola kubela mambu aga. Ndi, yikuvagana kuguna, mkotoka kuhenga chindu changa hololela. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ndava muni muvaletili vandu apa, pamonga vayivi lepi vindu vya nyumba ya chapanga amala kumliga chapanga witu wa chidala. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ngati, Demetilio na vana lihengu vaki vavi na mhalu wavi ndava ya vandu ava, gavi kulibanji la mihalu na kwa na vakulu va miji, vihotola kutakila kwenuko. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ngati muvi na mambu gangi, mugapeleka mumngonganu wewuyidakiliwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Muni tivii muhatali ya kutakiliwa ndava ya chitututu cha lelu, muni kawaka chanzu cha chitututu chenichi.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Peamali kujova genago, akamala mngonganu.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Pauli ihamba kavili ku Makedonia na ku Ugiliki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Chitututu chila pechamaliki Pauli avakemili vamsadika vala akavakangamalisa mtima. Kangi akalagana nawu na kuhamba Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Apitayi pandi za muji wula kuvakangamalisa vandu mitima mu malovi gaki gamahele, na kuhika ku Ugiliki. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Kwenuko atamili miyehi yidatu. Hinu peajitendeleka kuhamba ku Silia, akamanya kuvya Vayawudi vavi mukumkitila mpangu uhakau, ndi akahamula kuwuya munjila ya ku Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Vandu ava ndi vealongosini nawu, Sapato mwana wa Piho mundu wa ku Belea, Alistako na Sekundo vandu va ku Tesalonike, vangi vavi Gayo mkolonjinji ku Delibe, Timoti pamonga na Tukiko na Tofimo vandu va kuhuma muji wa Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Vandu ava vatilongolili na kuhamba kutilindila ku Tloa kula. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Nambu tete, pawamaliki Mselebuko wa Mabumunda gangali ngemeku, tayingili muwatu kuhuma ku Filipi, mulugendu lwa magono mhanu ndi tikahika ku Tloa. Tatamili kwenuko lijuma limonga.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga akumuyukisa Tukiko munjila ya Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ndi Jumamosi kimihi takonganiki ndava ya kulya pamonga. Muni Pauli aganayi kuwuka chilau yaki, ndi avakokosili vandu mbaka pagati ya kilu. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Kugolofa kwetakonganiki kwavili na hahi zamahele ziyaka. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Msongolo mmonga liina laki Eutuko atamili palidilisha lukumbi Pauli ikokosa palukumbi lutali. Eutiko atumbwili kutitila lugono hati pamwishu lugono lwamgalisi akagwa kuhuma ku golofa ya datu mbaka pahi. Pevahambili kumyinula vamkoli amali kufwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Pauli akahuluka pahi, akajigonesa panani yaki na kumkumbatila, akajova, “Mkoto kuvemba ndava avi mumi.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Akakwela kavili kuchumba cha kunani kula, akanukula libumunda na kulya. Akayendelela kukokosa kwa lukumbi lutali mbaka hambakucha, kangi akawuka. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Vandu vala vakawuya nayu msongolo yula kunyumba alamili hotohoto, ndi vakapoleswa neju.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lugendu lwa kuhuma ku Toloa kuhamba ku Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Nambu tete tayingili muwatu kulongolela ku Aso kwetikumtola Pauli. Ndi cheapangili mwene muni aganili kuhika kwenuko munjila ya kundumba. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Hinu atikolili ku Aso tikamutola muwatu, na kuhamba nayu Mitulene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Tavi mulugendu lwa kuhuma kwenuko na chilau yaki tahikili Kio. Pamalau yaki tahikili ku Samo na Pamtondogolo yaki tikahika ku Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Ndava Pauli aganili lepi kuvedukila ku Efeso muni akotoka kutamakisa neju mulima wa Asia. Ayumbatika kuhika ku Yelusalemu kumselebuko wa Pentekoste ngati yihotoleka.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuvalaga vagogo va ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kuhuma Mileto Pauli avatumili ujumbi kwa vachilongosi va msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Efeso vakonganika nayu. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Hinu pavamhikalili akavajovela, mwavene mmanyili chenitamili na nyenye magono goha kutumbula ligono la kutumbula panahikili mulima uwu wa Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mmanyili chenimuhengili Bambu cha ungolongondi woha, na maholi, mu mang'ahiso goha geganikolili ndava mipangu mihakau ya Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Mmanyili kuvya hati padebe nayogwipi lepi kuvakokosela pavandu na munyumba zinu, kuvawula chochoha chechikuvatangatila. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Navabesili vandu voha, Vayawudi na vangali Vayawudi, vamuwuyila Chapanga na kumsadika Bambu witu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Hinu, myuwanila! Nikumyidakila Mpungu Msopi, nihamba ku Yelusalemu changali kumanya gegakunikolela. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Nga chindu chimonga chenikuchimanya, Mpungu Msopi akunilangisa kuvya mukila muji chifungu na mang'ahiso ndi vyevyi kunilindila. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Nambu nivalanga lepi wumi wangu kuvya chindu, kwa nene ndi kumalakisa utumi wa lihengu lila leanipelili Bambu Yesu, kujova ndava ya Linenu la Bwina la ubwina wa Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Nigendili pagati yinu mwavoha kukokosa Unkosi wa Chapanga. Nambu hinu, nimanyili avi lepi mundu hati mmonga winu mweakuniwona kavili. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Hinu lelu nijova chakaka, kuvya mmonga winu akayaga, mhalu wa nene lepi. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Ndava muni hata padebe naleki lepi kuvakokosela mwapangu woha wa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Mujiyangalila mwavene, myungayi msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu uwu, Mpungu Msopi avaviki nyenye mvya valonda vaki. Leajipatili kwa ngasi ya Mwana waki. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Nimanyili kuvya peniwukayi, mabwa gakali ga kudahi yati gavazangila changali lipyana msambi wenuwo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Hati pagati yinu yati vihumila vandu veviwula mawuliwu ga udesi muni vavayaganisa vamsadika, vavalanda vene. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ndava ya yeniyo, mvya mihu kuni mukumbukayi kuvya mulukumbi lwa miyaka yidatu muhi na kilu katu nalekili lepi kumbesa kila mmonga winu kwa maholi.”<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Hinu ndi, nikuvavika nyenye pahi muulonda waki Chapanga na ujumbi wa mota yaki. Mwene anauhotola wa kuvasindimalisa na kuvapela uhali pamonga nawu vandu vaki vamsopi. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Nene nanogili lepi mashonga amala zahabu amala nyula za mundu yeyoha. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Mwavene mmanyili kuvya namwene nihegili lihengu mu mawoko gangu, ndava ya kupata gegiganikiwa kwa nene na vayangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Pamahele nivalangisi luhumu kuvya kuhenga mahengu neju, yikutigana kuvatangatila vangali makakala, na tikumbuka mu malovi ga Bambu Yesu mwene, ‘Mbanga neju kuwusa kuliku kupokela.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Peamali kujova genago, Pauli akafugama pamonga nawu voha akayupa kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Voha vakavya mukuvemba neju, pevalaga Pauli kuni vamkumbatili cha uganu. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Lijambu lelavavinisi neju ndi lila leajovili yati vakumlola lepi kavili. Hinu ndi vamhindikili mbaka muwatu.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pauli ihamba ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Patamali kulagana nawu, tayingili muwatu na kuhamba lumonga mbaka Kosi. Chilau yaki tahikili kumuji wa Lode, na patahumili kwenuko tikahamba kumuji wa Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Kula taukolili watu wewihamba mbaka ku Foinike, ndi tikayingila na kuyendelela lugendu. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ndi patahikili pandu patahotwili kulola Kuplo, tikahamba upandi wa kusini mbaka Silia. Tikahamba kuyima ku Tilo ndi pandu pa watu wula payahulusayi ndwika. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Kwenuko tavakoli vamsadika, tatamili nawu mulukumbi lwa lijuma limonga. Vamsadika venavo vakavya vilongela mukulongoswa na Mpungu Msopi, vakamjovela Pauli akotoka kuhamba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Nambu lukumbi lwitu palwamaliki tavoha tawukili. Vawuliwa pamonga na vadala na vana vavi vatihindikili mbaka kuvala ya muji. Patahikili kumbwani tavoha tikafugama na kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Kangi patamali kulagana nawu, tayingili muwatu na vene vakawuya kunyumba zavi.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Tete tayendalili na lugendu lwitu tahumili ku Tilo na kuhamba Tolemai kwetavajambwisi valongo vitu, tatamili nawu ligono limonga. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Chilau yaki tahumili penapo na kuhamba Kaisalia. Kwenuko tikatama kunyumba ya Filipi mkokosa wa Linenu la Bwina. Mwene ndi avi mmonga wa vamtangatila saba vevahaguliwi ku Yelusalemu kula. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Mwenuyu avi na vakamwali mcheche vevavi na chipanji cha kulota malovi ga Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Patatamili kwenuko magono gamahele, mlota mmonga wa Chapanga liina laki Agabo ahikili kuhuma ku Yudea. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ndi atibwelili, akatola mkungi wa Pauli akajikunga mawoko na magendelu, akajova, “Mpungu Msopi ajovili aga, ‘Vayawudi va ku Yelusalemu kula yati vakumkunga mewa mundu mweavi na mkungi uwu na kumgotola kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Patayuwini genago, tete pamonga na vandu vangi vevavi penapo, tamuyupili Pauli akotoka kuhamba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Nambu Pauli avayangwili, “Ndava kyani mwivemba? Na kunidenya mtima? Nijitendelekili, lepi ndava ya kukungiwa ndu ku Yelusalemu, nambu hati mewawa kufwa ndava ya liina la Bambu Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Peabeli getamjovili tagunii tikajova, “Maganu ga Bambu gahengekayi!”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Patamali kutama mulukumbi, ndi takungili ndwika yitu, tayendalili na lugendu kuhamba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Vamsadika nunuyu va ku Kaisalia valongosini na tete, vatipeliki kunyumba ya mundu mmonga liina laki Mnasoni, ndi mwetahambayi kutama kwa lukumbi. Mwenuyo avi mkolonjinji wa muji wa Kuplo, msadika wa kadeni.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akumgendela Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Hinu patahikili ku Yelusalemu, vamsadika vayitu vatipokili kwa luheku. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Chilau yaki Pauli pamonga na tete tahambili kumjambusa Yakobo na vagogo voha va msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Patamali kuvajambusa, Pauli avajovili mambu goha Chapanga geagahengili kwa vandu vangalikuvya Vayawudi munjila ya lihengu laki. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ndi pavagayuwini ago, vakamulumba Chapanga. Kangi vakamjovela Pauli, “Mlongo, uhotola kulola kuvya vavi maelufu ga Vayawudi vevavi vamsadika hinu na voha vilanda cha kukangamala malagizu ga Bambu geampeli Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Vayuwini mambu gaku gewiwula Vayawudi vevitama pagati ya vandu vangalikuvya Vayawudi, kuvya vakotoka kulanda malagizu ga Bambu geampeli Musa, vakotoka kuvadumula jandu vana vavi kavili vakotoka kulanda mivelu ya Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Hinu tikita wuli? Chakaka yati viyuwana kuvya ubwelili. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Hinu kitayi ngati chetikujovela, penapa tivii na vagosi mcheche vevaviki chilapu kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Uwungana nawu mukuyupa kunyambiswa, ulipa mashonga gegiganikwa, kangi vaketewayi mayunju gavi. Ndi vandu voha yati vimanya kuvya mambu gala gevayuwini kukuvala veve gangali mana, ndi wamwene wakona witama na kulanda malagizu ga Malagizu ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Nambu kuvavala vandu vangalikuvya Vayawudi vevasadiki, tivapelekili balua yetiyandiki mambu getihamwili, vakotoka kulya chindu chochoha chechiwusiwi luteta vachapanga va udesi, vakotoka kunywa ngasi, na vakotoka kulya nyama ya hinyama yidodanu, vayepa ukemi.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Hinu chilau yaki Pauli akavatola vandu vala muni ajinyambisa nawu pamonga, kangi akayingila Munyumba ya Chapanga, na kujova ligono la mwishu la kunyambiswa na luteta lweluwusiwa ndava ya kila mmonga.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ikamuliwa Munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Hinu magono gala saba pagihegelela kumalika, Vayawudi vevahumili wa Asia vamuwene Pauli Munyumba ya Chapanga. Ndi vakavakohokea ligoga msambi woha wa vandu, ndi vakamkamula. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Vakaywanga, “Vagosi va Isilaeli, mutitangatila! Mundu mwenuyu ndi mweakuvawula vandu kila pandu mambu gegibelana na vandu va Isilaeli, gegibesa malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa na pandu apa Pamsopi. Hati hinu avayingisi vandu vangali Vayawudi Munyumba ya Chapanga na kupahakasa pandu pamsopi.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Vajovili genago ndava vamuwene Tofimo mkolonjinji wa ku Efeso, alongosini na Pauli kumujini, vakaholalela manya Pauli amuyingisi Munyumba ya Chapanga.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Chitututu chadandasiki muji woha, vandu vakonganiki kuhuma pandi zoha, vakamukamula Pauli, vakamuhuta na kumuhumisa kuvala ya Nyumba ya Chapanga, na bahapo milyangu hikadindwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Pavalingili kumkoma Pauli, malovi gala gakamhikila mkulu wa msambi wa ku Loma kuvya Yelusalemu yoha yimemili chitututu. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Bahapo mkulu wa msambi akavatola manjolinjoli na vachilongosi wavi, vakavajumbila kuhamba. Vayawudi pavamuwene mkulu wa msambi pamonga na manjolinjoli vakaleka kumtova Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mkulu wa msambi yula akamhegelela Pauli, akamkamula na kulagiza akungiwayi minyololo yivili. Kangi akakota, “Mwenuyu ndi yani? Abudili kyani?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Vangi mu msambi wula vakavya mukuywanga vangi aga na vangi gala. Ndava ya chitututu, mkulu wa msambi wa manjolinjoli amanyili lepi uchakaka wa mhalu waki. Ndi akahamula vandu vaki vampeleka mugati ya ngomi ya manjolinjoli. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Pauli pahaikili pangazi, yavaganili manjolinjoli kumgega ndava ya chitututu cha vandu. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Ndava muni msambi wa vandu uvaha vamlandili kuni viywanga, “Mkomayi!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akujikengelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Pavamuyingisa mungomi, Pauli akamuyupa mkulu wa msambi wa manjolinjoli yula, “Nihotola kukujovela chindu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Mkulu wa msambi wa manjolinjoli akamkota, “Wu, umanya kujova Chigiliki? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Wu, veve ndi Mmisili yula magono gegapitili atumbwili chitututu na kuvalongosa vakomaji elufu mcheche kuhamba kulugangatu?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Pauli akayangula, “Nene na Myawudi, mkolonjinji wa ku Taso muji wa Kilikia, muji weutopeswa. Chondi niyidakila nilongela na vandu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Mkulu wa msambi wa manjolinjoli yula akamyidakila. Ndi Pauli akayima panani ya ngazi akavapungila vandu chiwoko, muni vaguna, akatumbula kulongela nawu muluga ya Chiebulania.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Valongo vangu na vadadi vangu, muyuwanila hinu chenikujikengelela palongolo yinu!” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Pevamuyuwini ilongela nawu kwa luga ya Chiebulania vakatama nuu neju. Kangi Pauli akayendelela kujova, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Nene na Myawudi mkolonjinji wa ku Taso muji wa Kilikia. Nambu naleliwi bahapa pa Yelusalemu. Muwula wangu Gamalieli. Nawuliwi kulanda malagizu ga vagogo vitu, najiwusili mtima woha kwa Chapanga ngati chemuvi nyenye lelu. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Navang'ahisi hati kuvakoma vandu vala vevalanda Njila ya Bambu. Navakamwili vagosi na vadala na kuvakunga muchifungu. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mteta mkulu wa Chapanga, vagogo voha va libanji vihotola kujova ndava ya lijambu lenili. Kuhumila kwavi napokili balua yevayandikiwi valongo Vayawudi vala, vevavi ku Damasko. Nahambili ku Damasko muni nivakamulayi vandu avo na kuvaleta kuni ku Yelusalemu, muni vabuniwayi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ilongela ndava ya kusanguka kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Matendu 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Hinu, panavili munjila papipi kuhika Damasko, lukumbi lwa saa sita ya muhi, lumuli luvaha kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga chigafula ukahumila na kunilangasa pandi zoha. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Penapo ndi nagwili pahi, nakuyuwana lwami lukunijovela, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Ndava kyani, ukuning'aha?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Hinu nakotili, yani Bambu? Aniyangwili, ‘Nene ndi Yesu wa ku Nazaleti mweukumung'aha.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Vayangu vala valuwene lumuli lula, nambu nakummanya lwami lwa mwenilongela nayu. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Ndi nikakota, ‘Nikita kyani, Bambu?’ Bambu akaniyangula, ‘Yima, uhamba ku Damasko na kwenuko yati ujoviwa goha geupangiwi kugahenga.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Mihu nakuhotola kulola ndava ya lumuli lula, hinu yavaganili vayangu vala kunilongosa mbaka kuhika ku Damasko.”<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Kwenuko kwavili na mundu mmonga liina laki Anania, mundu mweakumtopesa Chapanga, mweilanda Mhilu wa Chapanga weampeli Musa na mweitopeswa neju na Vayawudi voha vevitama ku Damasko. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Mwene abwelili kunilola, akanihegelela na kunijovela, ‘Mlongo wangu Sauli! Lola kavili.’ Bahapo nikahotola kumlola. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Kangi Anania akajova, ‘Chapanga wa vagogo vitu akuhagwili veve uhotola kumanya maganu gaki, kumlola Mweikita geigana Chapanga, na kumyuwana malovi gaki. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Ndava muni yati wijova ndava yaki kwa vandu voha gala geugawene na kuyuwana. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Hinu ndi, ndava kyani kutamakisa? Yima, ubatiziwayi na kulekekeswa geumbudili Chapanga kwa njila yeniyi ukulikemela liina la Yesu.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuvakokosela vandu vangalikuvya Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Hinu nawuyili ku Yelusalemu, na panavili mukuyupa Munyumba ya Chapanga, nagawene maono. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Namuwene Bambu akunijovela, ‘Yumbatika! Wuka Yelusalemu kanyata, ndava muni vandu va penapa yati vakukuyidakila lepi mukujova kwaku ndava yangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nikamyangula, Bambu, vandu ava vimanya hotohoto kuvya nene ndi yula mwenahambayi munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na kuvakamula na kuvatova vala vevakusadikayi. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Na lukumbi Stefani mweijova ndava yaku peakomiwi, namwene navili nayidakili lepi chitendu chenicho hati navi mlonda wa nyula za vakomaji vala. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Kangi Bambu akanijovela, ‘Hamba, Yati nikutuma kutali kwa vangali Vayawudi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Msambi wa vandu wamuyuwanili Pauli mbaka peajovili malovi ago. Kangi vakajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Mkoma mundu uyu! Mundu ngati uyu iganikiwa lepi kutama pamulima.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Ndi vayendalili kuywanga kuni vitaga nyula zavi na kutikula lububu kunani. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mkulu wa msambi wa manjolinjoli avalagizi vandu vaki vampeleka Pauli mungomi, akavajovela vamtova michapilu muni amanya ndava kyani Vayawudi vakumywangila. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Nambu pevamalili kumkunga Pauli muni vamtovayi, mwene akamkota chilongosi mmonga wa manjolinjoli mweayimi penapo, “Malagizu ginu yikuvayidakila kumtova mkolonjinji wa ku Loma angahamuliwa?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Hinu chilongosi yula peayuwini genago, akamjovela mkulu wa msambi wa manjolinjoli akajova, “Wigana kukita kyani? Mundu uyu ndi mkolonjinji wa ku Loma!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Hinu mkulu yula amhambalili Pauli, akamkota, “Nijovela, veve ndi mkolonjinji wa ku Loma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Pauli akayangula, “Ena.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Kangi mkulu yula akayendelela kujova, “Nene namkolonjinji wa Loma wa kugula kwa mashonga gamahele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Pauli akajova, “Nambu nene namkolonjinji wa Loma mukuvelekewa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Vandu vala vevamkotekesayi na kumtova michapilu Pauli bahapo vakawuka. Hati mkulu yula akayogopa peamanyili kuvya Pauli mkolonjinji wa ku Loma na kuni amkungili minyololo.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli pa libanji la mihalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Chilau yaki mkulu wa msambi wa manjolinjoli aganili kumanya matakilu ga Vayawudi gevamtakili Pauli. Ndi amuwopwili minyololo na akalagiza vamteta vakulu va Chapanga na vagogo va libanji loha vakonganeka. Kangi amletili Pauli na kumyimika palongolo yavi.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pauli avalolokisi takataka vandu vevakonganiki palibanji vala na kujova, “Valongo vangu, mbaka lelu iyi nihotwili kutama kwa kuhenga gakumganisa Chapanga.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Mkulu wa kuteta wa Chapanga, mweikemiwa Anania akalagazila vevayimili papipi na Pauli vampamanda likofi mumlomo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Hinu Pauli akamjovela, “Chapanga mwene yati akutova likofi wamwene mweukujikita mbwina, mweuvi ngati luwumba lwevabakili chokaa! Wihotola wuli kutama na kuhukumwa malagizu kuni wamwene ukugadenya malagizu genago kwa kulagiza nene nitoviwayi?”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Vandu vevayimili penapo vakamjovela Pauli “Ukumliga Mteta Mkulu wa Chapanga!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pauli akajova, “Valongo vangu, namanyili lepi ngati mwene ndi Mteta Mkulu wa Chapanga. Ndava muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, ‘Ukotoka kujova gahakau kumvala chilongosi wa vandu vaku.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Lukumbi lwenulo ndi Pauli amali kumanya vandu vangi mu libanji lila vavi Vafalisayu na vangi Vasadukayu. Akajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Valongo vangu, nene namfalisayu mwana wa mfalisayu. Vanitakili mu libanji kuvya nisadika vandu vevafwili yati viyuka.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Peamali kujova malovi ago kanyata ukahumila muhutanu pagati ya Vafalisayu na Vasadukayu mngonganu wapechengini. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Muhutanu wene wavi, Vasadukayu vijova kuvya vandu vevafwili viyuka lepi, vavi lepi vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga. Mpungu nawene uvi lepi. Nambu Vafalisayu visadika goha ago gadatu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Pakavya na njowo zamahele neju ndi vawula vangi va chikundi cha Vafalisayu vakayima na kujovesana kwa makakala, “Tichiweni lepi chihakau chochoha kwa mundu uyu, pangi kuvya mpungu amala mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga valongili nayu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Muhutanu wavi uvaha neju hati mkulu wa msambi ayogwipi kuvya Pauli yati vakumpapulana hipandi hipandi. Ndi avalagizi manjolinjoli waki kuyingila pagati yaki, vamuwusayi Pauli na kumuwuyisa muchifungu.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Kilu yiyoyo Bambu akamuhumila Pauli na kumjovela “Jipolesa mtima! Cheujova ndava yangu ku Yelusalemu apa yati wikita mewa Kumuji wa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi vikita mapangu wa kumkoma Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Kwapachili Vayawudi vakakonganeka na kukita mpangu, vakalapa yati vinywa lepi amala kulya mbaka vamkomayi Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Vala vevakitili mpangu wenuwo vavi neju ya vandu alobaini. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ndi vakahamba kwa vakulu va vakuteta va Chapanga na vagogo, vakajova, “Tete tiviki chilapu yati nakulya chindu chochoha mbaka timkomayi Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Hinu, nyenye pamonga na libanji mutuma ujumbi kwa mkulu wa msambi muni amletayi Pauli kwinu kudetekesa kuvya mwigana kuyuwana malovi goha ga kumvala mwene. Tijitendelekili kumkoma kwakona hati kuhika kwa nyenye.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Nambu mwana wa mlumbu waki Pauli ayuwini mpangu wula, ndi akahamba muchifungu kumjovela Pauli malovi genago. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Kangi Pauli akamkemala mmonga wa valonda, akamjovela “Mtola msongolo mwenuyu, mpeleka kwa chilongosi wa msambi muni avi na lijambu la kumjovela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Ndi akamtola na kuhamba nayu mbaka kwa mkulu wa msambi akamjovela, “Pauli mweavimuchifungu yula anikemili na kuniyupa nimletayi msongolo uyu kwa veve muni avi na linenu leigana kukujovela.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mkulu wa msambi akamkamula chiwoko msongolo yula na kuhamba nayu pandu pachiepela, akamkota, “Ugana kunijovela kyani?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Na akajova, “Vayawudi vayidakilini kukuyupa umpeleka Pauli chilau pa libanji chakudetekesela vandu va libanji vigana kuyuwana hotohoto malovi gaki. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Nambu veve belayi luyupu lwavi ndava vavi vandu neju ya alobaini vakumbajamila, vaviki chilapu vinywa lepi amala kulya chindu mbaka vamkomayi, hinu vilindila uhamula waku.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mkulu wa msambi akamleka awuka, akambesa akotoka kumjovela mundu yoyoha kuvya anidandaulili.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ipelekwa kwa mkulu Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Kangi Mkulu wa msambi akavakemela vakulu vaki vavili va vachilongosi akavalagiza, “Mutendelekela manjolinjoli miya zivili, vakwela falasi sabini, na manjolinjoli miya zivili wa migoha, vahamba ku Kaisalia, muwuka kwakona kuhika saa yidatu ya kilu lelu. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Mutendelekela falasi yungi ndava kumgega Pauli, mumhikisa changalemaswa kwa Felikisi Mkulu wa ku Yudea.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Mkulu wa msambi yula ndi akayandika balua iyi, <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Nene Kilaudio Lusia nikuyandikila mtopeswa mkulu Felikisi. Tikuwoni! <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Mundu uyu akamuliwi na Vayawudi na vavi papipi kumkoma, penayuwini kuvya mwene mkolonjinji wa ku Loma, nikahamba pamonga na chikundi cha manjolinjoli, nikamkengelela. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Nampeliki palongolo ya libanji lavi likulu nihotola kumanya muhalu wewamtakili. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ndi namanyili kuvya vamtakili ndava ya muhutanu wa malagizu gavi, nambu akitili lepi uhakau wowoha wewukumgana akomiwa amala akungiwa muchifungu. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Panayuwini kuvya Vayawudi vaviki mpangu wa kumkoma, nahamwili vamletayi kwaku, mewawa nivajovili vevamtakili valeta matakilu gavi kwaku.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Hinu, manjolinjoli vala vamtolili Pauli ngati chavalagaziwi. Kilu yilayila vakamupeleka mbaka Antipatili. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Chilau yaki manjolinjoli va magendelu vala vawuyili kujela, vavalekili vayavi vevikwela falasi vayendelela na lugendu pamonga na Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Pavahikili ku Kaisalia, vakampela Felikisi mkulu wa mkowa balua yila na kumgotola Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Felikisi peamali kuyisoma balua yila akamkota Pauli ahumili mulima woki. Peamanywisi kuvya ahumili Kukilikia, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />akajova, “Yati nikuuyuwanila muhalu waku vala vevakutakili vakamala kuhika.” Kangi akalagiza Pauli avikiwayi munyumba ya unkosi wa Helodi na kumlindalila.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Vayawudi vakumtakila Pauli kwa Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Peyahikili ligono la mhanu, Mteta mkulu Anania ahikili Kukaisalia pamonga na vagogo vangi na mmanya malagizu mmonga wa Loma, liina laki Tetulo, ndi vamhambalili mkulu wa mkowa na kumtakila Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Pauli akakemelewa, na Tetulo akatumbula kumtakila, “Mtopeswa Felikisi, ulongosi waku utiletili uteke uvaha na kavili utiletili mang'amusi gamahele gabwina ndava ya vandu vitu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Lijambu lenili tikulipokela cha luheku magono goha na tikusengusa neju. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Nambu changali kuyagisa lukumbi lutali, chondi kwa lipyana laku utiyuwanila padebe malovi gitu. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Tihumbwili kuvya mundu uyu avi na luhonda, mtumbulanu wa chitututu pagati ya Vayawudi kila pandu pamulima. Mewawa ndi chilongosi wa chikundi cha njila ya kumuyupa Chapanga chechikemelewa va Nazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Na hati alingili kuhakasa Nyumba ya Chapanga, tete tamkamwili. Taganili kumuhukumwa kwa mhilu witu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Nambu Lusia mkulu wa msambi abwelili na kumuwusa pagati yitu kwa makakala, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Wamwene ngati ukumkota mundu uyu yati wimanyalila mambu gala getamtakili tete.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Vayawudi kwa pamonga vakayidakila na kujova goha ago ndi gachakaka.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akujikengelela palongolo ya Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Kangi mkulu Felikisi akamlangisa Pauli kujova, mwene akajova, “Nimanyili kuvya veve ndi mhamula mihalu wa magono gamahele wa vandu vitu, nihekelela kujikengelela namwene. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Wihotola kumanya kuvya gapiti lepi magono kumi na gavili kuhumila penahambili ku Yelusalemu kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Vandu ava vanikoli lepi nikotana na mundu yoyoha amala vanikoli lepi nikuvakoakeha vandu mu Nyumba ya Chapanga amala munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi, amala pandu popoha pamuji wenuwo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Vihotola lepi kujova uchakaka wa mambu aga gevakunitakila. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Nambu chindu cheniyidakila ndi kuvya nikumuhengela Chapanga wa vagogo vitu, nitama mukulanda Njila yevikemela chikundi cha njila ya kumuyupa Chapanga. Nene nisadika goha gegayandikiwi muhitabu ya malagizu na muhitabu ya vamlota va Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Nene nikumsadika Chapanga ngati chavisadika vandu ava, kuvya vandu vevamganisa na vevakum'budila Chapanga voha ya viyuka kwevafwili. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ndava yeniyo nikujikangamalisa magono goha kutama wumi wa bwina changali kumbudila Chapanga na vandu.”<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Panakatamili kutali mumiyaka yamahele, nawuyili ku Yelusalemu muni nivaletela vakolonjinji vayangu mtangatilu na kuwusa luteta. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Lukumbi lwe nahengayi mambu ago ndi pavanikolili Munyumba ya Chapanga, namali kuwusa luteta lwa kunyambiswa. Pavi lepi msambi wa vandu amala chitututu. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Nambu kwavili na Vayawudi vangi kuhuma mulima wa ku Asia, venavo ndi veviganikiwa kuhika palongolo yaku na kunitakila ngati vana linenu la kujova ndava yangu. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Amala, vandu ava vevavi penapa vajova chenibudili pevanikolili niyimili palongolo ya libanji lavi likulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Ndi malovi ndu aga genajovili panakavili palongolo yavi, ‘Mukunihamula lelu iyi ndava ya kusadika kuvya vevafwili yati viyuka.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Hinu Felikisi, mweamanyili bwina njila yeniyo, akahegelesa muhalu wula mu ligono lingi. Akavajovela, “Yati nihamula muhalu uwu lukumbi Lusia Mkulu wa msambi, peibwela.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Kangi akamlagiza chilongosi wa manjolinjoli yula vamlindalila Pauli, nambu avyai mukulekekeswa padebe, vankozi vaki vayidakiliwa kumtangatila.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli palongolo ya Felikisi na Dulusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Mu magono gegagelekili Felikisi abwelili pamonga na mdala waki Dilusila mweavi Myawudi. Akalagiza Pauli aletewayi, akamyuwanila ilongela ndava ya kumsadika Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Nambu lukumbi Pauli peatumbwili kudandaula gakumganisa Chapanga, na kujiyepesa na uhamula wa Chapanga wewibwela, Felikisi ayogwipi, akajova, “Ndava hinu wihotola kuhamba, yati nikukukemela kavili panipata nafwasi.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Lukumbi lwenulo alindila manya Pauli ngaampeli mashonga. Ndava ya yeniyo amkemela pamahele kulongela nayu.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Payamaliki miyaka yivili, Polikio Festo akavya Mkulu wa ku Yudea. Nambu Felikisi ndava ya kujiganisa kwa Vayawudi, mwene akamlekekesa Pauli kuhuma muchifungu.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Pauli ipelekwa kwa Nkosi wa ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Magono gadatu, Festo patumbwili lihengu akawuka ku Kaisalia na kuhamba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Vakulu va kuteta pamonga na vachilongosi va Vayawudi vakamjovela matakilu gegakumvala Pauli. Vakamuyupa neju Festo, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />vakamuyupa neju Festo, alagazila Pauli vamletayi ku Yelusalemu, muni vavikili mpangu wa kumkoma akona munjila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Nambu Festo avayangwili, “Pauli yati isigalila kukoko muchifungu Kaisalia namwene yati nihamba kanyata kwenuko. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Mvajovela vachilongosi vinu valongosana na nene kuhamba kwenuko, vakamtakila palongolo yangu, ngati abudili chindu.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festo akatama nawu mulukumbi lwa magono nane amala kumi, kangi akawuya ku Kaisalia. Chilau yaki akahamba pa libanji, akalagizila Pauli vamletayi mugati. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Lukumbi Pauli ahikili, Vayawudi vevahumili ku Yelusalemu vamtindili vakatumbula kumtakila gamahele geginonopa nambu nakuhotola kujova uchakaka. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Kangi Pauli ajikengelili mukujova, “Nene nibudili lepi chindu chochoha pa malagizu ga Vayawudi amala ndava Nyumba ya Chapanga amala kumvala Nkosi wa ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Nambu Festo ndava aganili kujiganisa kwa Vayawudi akamkota Pauli, “Wu wigana kuhamba ku Yelusalemu uhamuliwa palongolo yangu ndava ya matakilu genaga?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pauli akayangula, “Niyima pa libanji la mihalu la nkosi wa ku Loma, bahapa ndi peniganikiwa kuhamuliwa. Wamwene umanyili bwina nivabudili lepi chindu chochoha Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ngati nene nambudaji amala nikitili chindu chechikunigana kukomiwa, nibela lepi kufwa. Nambu ngati kawaka uchakaka wa malovi gevanitakili ago, avi lepi mundu wa kunigotola kwa vene. Niyupa muhalu wangu ukahamuliwa kwa nkosi wa ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Hinu Festo peamali kulongela na vamtangatila vaki mu libanji, ndi akamjovela Pauli, “Uyupili lufani kwa nkosi wa ku Loma, yati wipelekwa kwa mwene.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli palongolo ya nkosi Agilipa na Benike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Magono gadebe gegagelekili, nkosi wa pandu pangi liina laki Agilipa na Belinike mweavi mlumbu waki, vahikili ku Kaisalia kumjambusa cha kumtopesa Festo. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Ndi vatamili kwenuko mu magono gamahele, Festo akamdandaulila nkosi mhalu wa Pauli, “Penapa avi mundu mmonga Felikisi amlekekesi Pauli kuhuma muchifungu. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Penakahambili ku Yelusalemu vakulu va kuteta va Chapanga na vachilongosi va Vayawudi vamtakili na kuniyupa nimuhamula akomiwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Nambu nene navayangwili kuvya mvelu lepi wa vandu va ku Loma kumgotola mundu alipiswai kwakona angakonganeka na vevamtakili mihu kwa mihu na kupata fwasi ya kujikengelela ndava ya mambu gevamtakili. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Hinu, pevamali kuhika penapa, ndi kanyata nakitili muhalu mulibanji chilau yaki, nalagazili mundu mwenuyu vamleta. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Vamtakila vaki vayimili nambu nakudandaula matakilu geabudili ngati chenalindilayi. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Pahali paki ndi vavi na muhutanu pamonga nayu ndava ya njila ya kumuyupa Chapanga wavi na mundu mmonga liina laki Yesu mweamali kufwa, nambu Pauli ikangamala kujova akona muni. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Namanyili lepi nikita kyani ndava ya muhalu wenuwo. Hinu, namkotili Pauli ngati igana kuhamba kulibanji la mihalu Yelusalemu kula, ndava ya matakilu ago. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Nambu Pauli akangamili kuyupa kusigalila muchifungu mbaka uhamula wa muhalu waki uhamuliwa na nkosi wa ku Loma. Ndava yeniyo nalagizi atama muchifungu mbaka penihotola kumpeleka kwa Kaisali.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Kangi Agilipa akamjovela Festo, “Namwene nigana kumuyuwanila mundu mwenuyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festo akamyangula, “Yati ukumuyuwanila chilau.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Hinu, chilau yaki Agilipa na Belinike vahikili kwa chilulu mu libanji la mihalu kuni valongosini na vakulu va msambi na vachilongosi va muji. Festo akalagiza Pauli vampeleka mugati. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Festo akajova, “Nkosi Agilipa pamonga na vandu voha mwemuvi apa na tete! Palongolo yinu avi mundu, vandu voha va mulima wa Vayawudi va bahapa na ku Yelusalemu, vakumng'ung'utila kuvya iganikiwa lepi kulama wumi waki kavili. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Nambu namwene nichiwene lepi chindu chochoha cheabudili hati kuganikiwa akomiwa. Hinu ndava mwene ayupili muhalu waki uhamuliwayi na Nkosi wa Loma, nahamwili kumpeleka. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Mewa namwene nivii lepi na malovi gakumyandikila Nkosi wa ku Loma ndava ya muhalu uwu. Ndi mana nimletili palongolo yinu, ndi neju veve Nkosi Agilipa, muni mukamala kumkotakesa, nimanya chindu cha kumyandikila. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ndava muni nihololela kuvya malovi gangali luhala kumpeleka mfungwa changali kulangisa matakilu gegakumvala.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Pauli akujikengelela mwene palongolo ya Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Hinu Agilipa akamjovela Pauli, “Wihotola kujova malovi ga kujikengelela.” Ndi Pauli akakwesa chiwoko na kutumbula kujova.<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Nkosi Agilipa, lelu niheka neju, kujikengelela palongolo yaku ndava ya mambu goha gevanitakili Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Neju ndava wamwene wimanya bwina mivelu ya Vayawudi na muhutanu wavi, nikuyupa uniyuwanila bwina.”<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Vayawudi voha vamanyili wumi wangu kutumbula uwana wangu, chenitamili kutumbula kadeni pamulima wangu ndi mewa ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Vanimanyili mu magono gamahele na vihotola kujova ndava yangu ngati vigana, kuvya kutumbula kadeni navili mmonga pagati ya chikundi cha Vafalisayu chechikangamalisa neju kulanda mvelu wa njila ya kumuyupa Chapanga yitu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Na hinu nivii palongolo yaku nihamuliwa ndava nisadika lilaganu lila Chapanga avalagazili vagogo vitu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Malaganu gene ndi galagala gegihuvalila na makabila kumi na gavili ga vandu vitu, vakumhengela Chapanga muhi na kilu. Mtopeswa nkosi, Vayawudi vakunitakila ndava ya sadika yeniyo! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Ndava kyani nyenye mwivya na mtahu kusadika kuvya Chapanga akuvayukisa vevafwili?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Chakaka namwene naholalili kuvya yikunigana kuhenga mambu kubela uhotola wa Yesu wa ku Nazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Mambu genakitili ku Yelusalemu, napatili uhotola kuhuma kwa vakulu va kuteta va Chapanga, navasopili muchifungu vandu vamahele vevakumganisa Chapanga, ndi pavahukumiwi kukomiwa, nayidakili kuvya vakomiwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Pamahele navalipisi munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi zoha, navajovili kwa makakala vayibela sadika yavi. Namemili ligoga ndava yavi hati navahakili mbaka mumiji ya kutali.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ilongela ndava ya kusanguka kwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Kwa lihengu lenilo, nahambili kumuji wa Damasko kwa uhotola na malagizu ga vamteta va vakulu va Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mtopeswa Nkosi, lukumbi nivii munjila, muhi wa saa sita nauwene lumuli luvaha kuliku wa lilanga utilangasa kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, wanitidili nene pamonga na vamulugendu vayangu. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Tavoha tete tagwili pahi, ndi nayuwini lwami lukunijovela kwa luga ya Chiebulania, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Ndava kyani ukuning'aha? Ukujilemasa waka ngati ng'ombi yeyitakula ndonga ya bambu waki.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Ndi nene namkotili, ‘Veve wayani Bambu?’ Bambu akayangula, ‘Nene ndi Yesu mweukuning'aha. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Nambu hinu yimuka, uyimayi. Nikuhumalili muni nikuvika kuvya mtangatila wangu. Ukavajovela vandu vangi mambu geugaweni lelu na gala genivii nakona kukulangisa. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Yati nikusangula kuhuma kwa vandu va Isilaeli na vandu vangali Vayawudi, ndi nene kwenikutuma kwavi. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Yati ukugagubukula mihu gavi muni uvang'anamusa vahuma muchitita na kuyingila mu lumuli, vahuma muulongosi wa Setani, vamuwuyila Chapanga, muni kunisadika nene valekekeswa gevamubudili Chapanga muni vatola uhali pamonga na vandu vevahaguliwi na Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ilongela ndava ya lihengu laki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Ndi, Nkosi Agilipa, nabelili lepi maono ago ga kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Hinu natumbwili hoti kuvakokosela vandu va ku Damasko, kangi kwa vandu va ku Yelusalemu na mulima woha wa ku Yudea mewawa kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi. Navakokosili vamuwuyila Chapanga kwa kulangisa mumatendu kuvya vang'anamwiki. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ndava ya genago Vayawudi vanikamwili Munyumba ya Chapanga, vakalinga kunikoma. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Nambu kwa ulonda wa Chapanga nakona muni hati lelu, nikuvajovela vadebe na vavaha. Nidandaula galagala vamlota va Chapanga na Musa vajovili yati gihumila, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />kuvya yamganili Kilisitu kung'aiswa na mutumbula kuyuka, muni akokosayi kuvya lumuli lwa usangula lukuvalangasa vandu voha, Vayawudi na vandu vangali Vayawudi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Pauli peajikengelelayi mu malovi ago, Festo akajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Pauli! Wipenga! Usomili neju ndi wipenga luhala.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Nambu Pauli akajova, “Mtopeswa Festo, nipenga lepi mu malovi genijova ndi gachakaka na gana luhala. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Wamwene Nkosi, ukugamanya mambu aga, hinu nihotola kulongela kwa ukekesi palongolo yaku. Mambu genago gamanyikini kwaku muni lijambu ilo lahengiki lepi mumfiyu. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Nkosi Agilipa, wu, ukugasadika gegajoviwi na vamlota vakadeni va Chapanga? Nimanyili kuvya ukugasadika.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipa akamyangula Pauli, “Wihololela kuvya mu malovi gadebe wihotola kunikulukisa kuvya Mkilisitu?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pauli akayangula, “Nikumuyupa Chapanga kuvya mulukumbi luhupi amala lutali lepi wamwene ndu, nambu voha vevakuniyuwanila lelu vahotola kuvya ngati chenivii nene, changali kukungwa minyololo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Kangi Nkosi Agilipa, mkulu Festo na Belinike na vandu voha vevatamii pamonga nawu, vakayima. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Pevamali kuwuka ndi vajovisini, “Mundu mwenuyu ahengili lepi chindu chihakau hati kuganikiwa kukomiwa amala chifungu.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agilipa akamjovela Festo “Mundu uyu ngaihotoliki kulekekeswa kuvyaa ayupili lepi uhamula kwa Nkosi wa ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Pauli ihamba lugendu ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Pevamali kuvika mpangu wa lugendu lwa tete kuhamba Italia, Pauli pamonga na vafungwa vangi vagotoliwi pahi pa ulonda wa Juliasi mweavi Mkulu wa msambi wa manjolinjoli pagati ya chikundi chechikemelewa “Chikundi cha Augusti.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tayingili muwatu wewahuma ku Adilamito wewavedukila mumbwani ya miji ya Asia. Kangi tawukili pamonga na mkolonjinji wa Makedonia kuhuma Tesalonike liina laki Alistako. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Chilau yaki tahikili kumbwani ya Sidoni. Juliasi amhengili lipyana Pauli kwa kumyidakila avalola vankozi vaki na kupata vindu vyaaganili. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kuhuma kwenuko, tagendili mumhana mwa chisiwa cha Kuplo ndava ya kuyepa mpungu wewabuma kuhuma kulongolo yitu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Kangi takupwiki nyanja ya upandi wa Kilikia na Pamfulia, tahikili Mula muji wa Lukia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Penapo Mkulu wa msambi yula, aukolili watu wewihuma ku Alekisandalia na kuhamba ku Italia, ndi akatiyingisa mugati.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Tagendili mbolimboli mulukumbi lwa magono gamahele cha kutyalatyala neju tahikili papipi na muji wa Nido. Ndava ya mpungu wewatikang'ayi kuhuma kulongolo ndi tikahamba lumonga upandi wa Kilete kuhamba pandu pa yeyikemiwa Salimone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tapitili mumhana ya mbwani kwa kutyalatyala na kuhika pandu pepikemelewa “Bandali ya Bwina,” Papipi na muji wa Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Lukumbi lwamahele lwamali kupita, hati magono ga kujihinisa chakulya gamaliki. Hinu vayogwipi neju lugendu lwa muwatu. Pauli akavajovela malovi aga.<verse eid="ACT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Mwavagosi, nihololela kuvya lugendu lwitu yati wivya na mang'ahiso na kuyagisa lepi ndava ya ndwika na watu ndu, nambu mewa na wumi witu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Nambu Mkulu wa manjolinjoli yula akasadika neju malovi ga mgendesa watu na ga mkolo watu, kuliku malovi ga Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Hinu ndava bandali yeniyo yavi lepi nafwasi ya bwina kutama lukumbi lwa mbepu. Ndi vamahele pagati yavi vayidakilini kuwuka penapo na kuhamba mbaka Foinike ngati yihotoleka na kutama kwenuko mkulukumbi lwa mbepu. Bandali ya Kilete yeyihamba kwelihumila lilanga na kusini kwelitipama lilanga.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpungu ukali na manji kutimbugana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Hinu, mpungu wa bwina pawatumbwili kubuma, vene vakahololela kuvya mpangu wavi wihotoleka, hinu vakahuta nanga vakatumbula lugendu kuni vigendesa watu papipi na mbwani ya Kilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Kwakona vangahika patali, mpungu ukali weukemiwa “Mpungu Eulokilo.” Watumbwili kubuma kuhuma muchisiwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Mpungu waukang'ili watu, wene wahotwili lepi kukangamala nawu, ndi taulekili mpungu uyikang'ayi. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Na petapitayi pachisiwa chidebe chechikemiwa Kauda, tatyalityali nambu tahotwili kuukunga mtumbwi wa watu. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Vanalihengu va muwatu pevamali kuyigisa mtumbwi wula mugati, ndi vakaukunga nyosi kwa makakala. Vayogwipi kukwama pa lilundu la masavati ga papipi na mbwani ya ku Libya, vakahelesa nyosi na kuleka watu wikang'iswa na mpungu. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Mpungu na manji gatimbungini na pachilau yaki, vakatumbula kutaga ndwika munyanja. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Na ligono la datu vakatumbula kutaga vindu vya watu kwa mawoko gavi vene. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Mu magono gamahele valiwene lepi lilanga amala ndondo, mpungu na manji vyayendalili kutimbugana neju, kuhuvalila kwa kusanguka gavamaliki.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Pavatamili magono gamahele changalya, Pauli akayima pagati yavi akajova, “Vamtopeswa, mbanga kuvya muniyuwanili malovi gangu ga kuleka kuwuka Kilete, ngatiyepili mang'ahiso ago pamonga na kuyagisa vindu ivi. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Nambu hinu nivayupa mjikangamalisa mtima, muni kawaka hati mundu mmonga mweiyagisa wumi waki, nambu watu wene ndi wewiyaga. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ndava muni golo kilu Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga, kuhuma kwa Chapanga mwenikumuhengela, anihumalili, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />akanijovela, ‘Pauli, kotoka kuyogopa! Yikukugana kuyima palongolo ya Nkosi wa ku Loma, Chapanga mwene yimganisi, ndi kwa ubwina waki akuvasangula wumi wa voha mulugendu lwinu.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Hinu vamtopeswa, mjikamngamalisa mtima ndava muni nikumsadika Chapanga kuvya givya mewawa ngati chenijoviwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Nambu yikutigana kutagwa kundumba ya chisiwa chimonga.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ligono la kumi na mcheche kilu manji pagatumbwili kutimbugana tikanga'iswa kuni na kula munyanja ya Adilia. Pagati ya kilu vanalihengu muwatu vaholalili kuvya papipi na pandumba. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Vakalonda utali wa pahi wa nyanja kwa kuhelesa nyosi yeyakungiwi chindu chechitopa, vapatili utali wa mita alobaini. Na pavapimili kavili mwanakandahi vapatili utali wa mita selasini. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Ndava ya kuyogopa kukwama mumatalau ndi vakahelesa nanga mcheche za upandi mumbele mwa watu, vakamuyupa Chapanga kwicha kanyata. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Vanalihengu va muwatu, vaganili kutila ndi vamali kuhelesa mtumbwi wavi mumanji, vakongayi kuvya vihamba kulongolo kuhelesa nanga za muwatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Nambu Pauli amjovili Mkulu wa msambi yula pamonga na manjolinjoli vangi, “Vanalihengu ava ngati vitama lepi mugati ya watu, yati mwisanguliwa lepi.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Penapo ndi manjolinjoli vala vakadumula nyosi zezakamwili mtumbwi wula, vakauleka uhamba na manji.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Papipi na hamba kucha, Pauli akavayupa voha valyayi chakulya, “Lelu ndi ligono la kumi na mcheche vavili na wogoyi lukumbi lwoha ulo mwangalya chindu. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Hinu, nikuvayupa mlyayi chakulya muni mukuchigana muhotola kulama, Muni kawaka hati luyunju lumonga wa mitu yinu lweluyaga.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Peamali kujova malovi ago, Pauli akatola libumunda, akamsengusa Chapanga palongolo yavi voha akametula akatumbula kulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Kangi voha vakasindimala mtima, navene mewa vakalya chakulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Mugati ya watu wula tavi vandu miya zivili na sabini na sita. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Pevamali kulya na kuyukuta kila mundu, ndi vapungwizi utopa kwa watu, kwa kutaga nganu munyanja.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watu widenyeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Kwapachili, vanalihengu vala vaumanyili lepi mulima wula, ndi vayiwene ndumba yeyivi papipi na manji, vakajovesana vayegeka watu kwenuko ngati yihotoleka. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ndi, vakadumula nanga na kuzileka munyanja, mewa vakahuta nyosi za kugendesela watu, kangi vakatola chitambala chimonga kulongolo kukinga mpungu, vakahamba kundumba. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Nambu vahikili pamngonganu wa manji, na watu wakwamili, upandi wa kulongolo wajwigwimi mumasavati changali kunyugusika. Upandi wa mumbele wa watu watumbwili kudenyekana hipandi hipandi ndava kukang'wa na mpungu ga manji ga kutimbugana.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Manjolinjoli vavi na mpangu wa kuvakoma vafungwa voha ndava ya kuyogopa kuvya vihotola kusambalila mbaka kundumba na kutila. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Nambu Mkulu wa msambi yula aganili kumsangula Pauli, avabesili valeka mpangu wavi. Akalagiza vevimanya kusambalila vahumba kuhuma muwatu na kusambalila mbaka kundumba, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />na vevasigalili vajisangula kwa kukamulila mbau amala chipandi cha watu weudenyiki, ndi tavoha tahikili tavamumi kundumba.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Pauli pachisiwa cha Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Patamali kuhika bwina kundumba ndi tamanyili kuvya chisiwa chila chikemelewa Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Takangisi ndava vakolonjinji vatihengili gabwina neju tete. Fula ndi yatumbula kutonya na kwavili na mbepu, hinu vakoyili motu na kutigongolela. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Pauli anongili ndwika udebe wa sagala akazikohokea pamotu, penapo ndava ya lyoto la motu, limoma lahumalili musagala na lamulumili Pauli muchiwoko na kujikamulisa. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Vala vakolonjinji pavawene limoma lijikamulisi dombeka muchiwoko cha Pauli, vakajovesana, “Chakaka mundu uyu mkomaji, pamonga na kusanguka kufwa munyanja, nambu lihoka litu lelikemiwa ganisa Chapanga likumleka lepi alama.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Nambu mwene akakung'undila limoma pamotu na alemili lepi hati padebe. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Vandu vala vevalolokesa kuvya yati ihimba amala kugwa pahi na kufwa. Pavalindili mulukumbi lutali changalola kuvya Pauli apatili lepi lijambu loloha lihakau, ndi vakang'anamusa maholo gavi vakujova mwene ndi lihoka.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Papipi na pandu apo pavili na migunda ya Publio, chilongosi wa chisiwa chila. Ndi mwene atigongolili cha uganu na tatamili munyumba yaki mu magono gadatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Hinu, dadi waki Publio agonili palusongwani, ndava ya utamu na kuseka ngasi. Ndi Pauli ahambili kumlola na peamali kumuyupa Chapanga, akavika mawoko gaki panani ya mtamu ndi akamlamisa. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Palahumalili lijambu lenilo, vatamu voha muchisiwa chenicho vabwelili na kulamiswa mewa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Vandu vatipelili njombi ndalindali lukumbi patatumbwili kavili lugendu vayingisi vindu vyoha vyetaganilli muwatu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ihuma ku Malita kuhamba ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Payamaliki miyehi yidatu tatumbwili kavili lugendu muwatu wewihuma ku Alekisandalia yeyihongoliwi chimong'omong'o ya “Vachapanga Mapaha.” Watu wenuwo wayimili muchisiwa icho mulukumbi lwoha lwa mbepu. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Patahikili pamuji wa Silakusa, tatamili penapo mu magono gadatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kuhuma kwenuko tagendili na kuhika kumuji wa Legio. Chilau yaki, mpungu wa kusini watumbwili kubuma, ndi mulugendu lwa magono gavili tahikili pamuji wa Putioli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Kwenuko tavakoli valongo vamsadika, ndi vatigongolili titama nawu mulijuma limonga. Kangi tayendalili na lugendu kuhika ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Vamsadika va ku Loma vala pevayuwini malovi ga kutivala tete, vakabwela kutali pandu pakugulisila vindu la Apio na Munyumba Zidatu za Vayehe kukonganeka na tete. Pauli peawene akamsengusa Chapanga na kusindimaliswa mtima.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ikokosa pamuji wa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Petahikili ku Loma Pauli ayidakiliwi kutama mwene pamonga na linjolinjoli mmonga wa kumlindalila.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Pagamaliki magono gadatu, Pauli avakemili pamonga vachilongosi va Vayawudi va pandu apo. Pavakonganiki mwene akavajovela, “Valongo vangu, nene nakungiwi muchifungu ku Yelusalemu kula na kugotolewa kwa vandu va ku Loma, nambu nene nahengili lepi chindu chihakau amala kubela mivelu ya vagogo vitu. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Valumi pevamali kunikotakesa vaganili kunilekekesa muni nahengili lepi chindu chihakau chechikunigana kukomiwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Nambu Vayawudi vala vakabela lijambu ilo, ndi nene nikayupa kuhamuliwa na Nkosi wa ku Loma, nambu navi lepi na chochoha cha kuvatakila vandu va mulima wangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ndava ya genago ndi nivakemelili tiwonanganayi na kulongela na nyenye, muni nikungiwi minyololo iyi ndava ya lilagizu la Chapanga kwa Isilaeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Vene vakamjovela, “Tete tipokili lepi balua ya kuhuma ku Yudea, mewa kawaka mlongo yoyoha mweahikili kutijovela lasimi amala kulongela chindu chochoha chihakau ndava yaku. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Nambu tigana kuyuwana maholo gaku wamwene, muni timanya kuvya chikundi chenicho chibelelewa kila pandu.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Hinu vakayidakilana ligono la kukonganeka nayu, vandu vamahele vamhikili peatamili. Kutumbula lukela mbaka kimihi Pauli avadandaulili na kuvajovela ujumbi wa kuuvala Unkosi wa Chapanga, alingili avakulukisi vayidakila mambu ga Yesu kwa kuhengela malagizu ga Bambu geampelili Musa na mayandiku ga vamlota va Chapanga. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Vangi pagati yavi vakofyiliwi malovi gaki, nambu vangi vasadiki lepi. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Hinu, vakapechengana mumaholo gavi vene kwa vene. Hinu vawukili ndava Pauli, ajovili lijambu limonga, “Mpungu Msopi avajovili chakaka vagogo vinu mu njila ya mlota wa Chapanga Isaya, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />akajova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Uvahambila vandu ava uvajovela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kuyuwana yati mwiyuwana, nambu nakumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kulola yati mwilola, nambu yati mwimanya lepi.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ndava mitima ya vandu ava yitopa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">vadindili makutu gavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na vakupiki mihu gavi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Ngati lepi kulola kwa mihu gavi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ngavayuwini kwa makutu gavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ngavamanyili kwa luhala lwavi na valeka njila zavi zihakau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">kangi nivalamisi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Kangi Pauli akajova, “Mmanya kuvya ujumbi wa Chapanga ndava ya kusanguliwa upelikwi kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi. Na vene yati vauyuwanila.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Pauli peamali kujova genago, Vayawudi vakawuka, vakakotana gamahele vene kwa vene.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Palukumbi lwa miyaka yivili, Pauli atamili munyumba yeapangili mwene, avagongolili munyumba vandu voha vevabwelili kumjambusa. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Avakokosili malovi ga Unkosi wa Chapanga na kuwula vandu ndava ya Bambu Yesu Kilisitu kwa ukekesi na changabesiwa na mundu.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>